//@version=6
indicator("Simple Quant+ v2.8.4 | HTF Chart Context", shorttitle="SQ+ v2.8.4", overlay=false, behind_chart=false, scale=scale.right, precision=4, max_lines_count=2, max_labels_count=10, max_bars_back=1000, dynamic_requests=true)

// v2.8.4 FINAL — 2026-09-18.
// • CHART-context MOM3/MOM6 no longer inherits the official trigger's same-session
//   warmup rule unless the visible chart timeframe exactly matches the trigger TF.
//   This keeps 5m trigger logic session-strict while allowing valid 1h/4h/1D
//   chart momentum to span consecutive chart bars.
// • CHART estimated flow/RVOL support is extended from 1-60m to 1m-1D. The
//   official trigger remains limited to its configured 1-60m choices.
// • TR HOURLY now also displays the latest native 1h Low-High snapshot on 4h/1D
//   charts; <=1h charts keep the causal aligned-bar accumulator.
// • When the confirmed Trend TF is lower than the visible chart TF, the script
//   now returns the latest fully completed, full-duration trend bar using a
//   lower-timeframe-safe last-intrabar request instead of selecting the shortened
//   final RTH fragment. This removes false PARTIAL BAR BLOCKED on 4h/1D charts.
// • ADX hysteresis now controls strength only; the current confirmed DI sign
//   always controls direction, preventing a stale BULL/BEAR label inside the
//   ADX 20/17 hysteresis band.
// • MOM warmup wording distinguishes a missing MOM value from a missing prior
//   comparison. Official DECISION remains fail-closed when chart TF > trigger TF.
//
// v2.8.3 FINAL — 2026-09-18.
// • Intraday Trend/Trigger/Decision, estimated flow and RVOL now follow the
//   active named TradingView chart session (`syminfo.session`): RTH, extended,
//   24h or a provider-defined subsession. The hidden 09:30-16:00 gate is gone.
// • Session resets use the chart-selected ticker plus `time_tradingday`, so
//   overnight sessions remain one trading session. A 1h trend now warms up only
//   for the first full hour of whichever chart session the user selected.
// • TR HOURLY continues to use the selected chart session automatically, but it
//   is released only when the visible chart timeframe evenly divides 60 minutes
//   and each chart bar fits wholly inside one 1h parent. Misaligned 7m/45m
//   charts fail closed instead of contaminating the hourly Low-High.
// • Daily Traditional Pivot remains previous completed native 1D H/L/C.
//
// v2.8.2 FINAL — 2026-09-18.
// • OVERALL TREND remains on the selected confirmed Trend TF.
// • RAW TRIGGER and DECISION remain on the selected Trigger TF.
// • Every supporting dashboard row now follows the visible CHART TF:
//   DMI/ADX, MOM3, MOM6, estimated flow, EMA20 and RVOL.
// • Removes the 12-trigger-bar rolling range and full-session extremes from the
//   dashboard. Exactly two simple trading ranges remain: the current chart bar
//   Low-High and the current session-anchored 1h bar Low-High.
// • TR here means Trading Range (actual Low-High), not Wilder True Range.
// • No TR lines are drawn. The only price-chart overlays remain EMA20 and Daily P.
// • Decision logic, reversal hysteresis and alerts are unchanged.
//
// v2.8.1 — 2026-09-17.
// • Renames ACTIVE RANGE to TRADING RANGE and puts the numeric range on the
//   next dashboard line for easier reading. The range still updates after every
//   completed trigger-timeframe bar; it is not frozen to an hourly refresh.
// • Restores conventional MOM3 and MOM6 display labels. MOM6 is true cumulative
//   momentum (close - close[6] at the default settings). DECISION still uses the
//   preceding non-overlapping 3-bar block internally, avoiding double-counting
//   the current MOM3 as independent confirmation.
// • Daily Traditional P/S1/R1 remain fixed from the previous completed native
//   daily H/L/C. They do not move with the chart, trigger timeframe or each hour.
// • Keeps the script below TradingView's 64-plot ceiling (estimated 60 plots).
//
// v2.8.0 FINAL — 2026-09-17.
// • Combines CONFIRM + ACTION into one official DECISION row.
// • RAW TRIGGER stays live for aggressive observation and may change intrabar.
// • DECISION is locked to the previous completed trigger bar; there is no live
//   ACTION mode, so an unfinished 5m bar cannot create an official CALL/PUT.
// • Adds reversal hysteresis: after an accepted CALL/PUT direction, the opposite
//   direction must qualify on two consecutive completed trigger bars by default.
//   A first opposite bar prints WAIT | REVERSAL 1/2 instead of flipping directly.
// • Initial same-direction entries remain one-bar decisions; WAIT does not erase
//   the last accepted side within the session, so later opposite signals still
//   pass the configured reversal check. State resets at the next session.
// • Keeps only EMA20 + Daily Pivot P on the price chart. TRADING RANGE and
//   SESSION EXTREMES remain dashboard/Data Window values with no drawn lines.
// • This is an entry-state research indicator, not a position/exit engine. A
//   higher-timeframe trend turning WAIT blocks new entries; it is not by itself
//   a stop-loss or an instruction to exit an existing trade.
//
// v2.7.3 — 2026-09-17.
// • Price-chart overlay is simplified to the chart EMA20 and Daily Pivot P.
//   The former optional VWAP visual is also removed; VWAP remains Data Window
//   reference only and never enters the decision logic.
// • ACTIVE RANGE and SESSION EXTREMES remain calculated and visible in the
//   dashboard/Data Window, but their horizontal lines and price-scale tags are
//   no longer drawn. Manual TradingView drawings are unaffected.
// • Keeps the v2.7.2 plot-limit fix and all Trend/Trigger/DECISION calculations.
//
// v2.7.2 — 2026-09-17.
// • Fixes TradingView RE10140 by reducing plot-count usage from 70 to
//   an estimated 59. Visible chart/dashboard behaviour is unchanged.
// • Removes only redundant Data Window audit plots for internal source
//   timestamps/references; the underlying calculations, tooltips, range,
//   Trend TF, Trigger TF, DECISION and alerts are unchanged.
//
// v2.7.1 — 2026-09-17.
// • Evidence-aligned overall-trend default: 1-3m trigger -> 15m trend;
//   5-15m trigger -> 1h trend; 30-60m trigger -> 4h trend.
// • The 5m -> 1h default follows the preserved A15-versus-D60 timeframe
//   ablation; it is a research default, not profitability certification.
// • Intraday DECISION waits for a full completed current-session trend bar;
//   the final short RTH fragment is never labelled a complete 1h/4h trend bar.
//
// v2.7.0 — 2026-09-17.
// • Separates confirmed OVERALL TREND from the lower-timeframe RAW TRIGGER.
// • Legacy v2.7.0 mapping was 1-5m -> 15m; v2.7.1 supersedes it above.
// • Uses previous completed trend bars, ADX hysteresis and normalized DI spread.
// • Normalizes setup by prior ATR and estimated Delta by parent-bar volume.
// • Replaces overlapping MOM6 with a preceding non-overlapping MOM block.
// • Adds CALL / PUT / WAIT decision logic, EMA no-chase gating.
// • Resets Delta polarity at each session and blocks prior-session MOM borrowing.
// • Adds an ACTIVE RANGE from prior completed trigger bars. The old daily band is
//   renamed SESSION EXTREMES and is OFF by default because it only expands.
// • Dashboard detail now uses the trigger/trend bases instead of chart-timeframe
//   values. The pane remains explicitly chart-diagnostic.
// This remains research software. Import/compile/live/reload qualification in
// TradingView is required before relying on alerts.

// v2.6.1 — 2026-09-17. VWAP is removed from the dashboard and from the
// visible decision sequence after the QQQ Alpaca SIP ablation did not support
// it as a mandatory filter. The VWAP calculation remains only for an optional
// price-chart reference and Data Window audit; its plot and end label are OFF
// by default. Trend/Trigger/Confirm and alerts remain unchanged. Dashboard order:
// DMI/ADX -> MOM3 -> MOM6 -> estimated CVD session/Δ1/ΔN -> EMA20 -> DAILY -> RVOL.
// This is a presentation/role refinement, not a profitability certification.
// v2.6.0 — 2026-09-17. User-facing decision flow is now explicitly
// TREND -> TRIGGER -> CONFIRMATION. TRIGGER is fixed to MOM3 + estimated Δ1
// agreement on the selected strategy timeframe. MOM6 is confirmation only:
// agreement = CONFIRMED; disagreement/flat = EARLY. It never vetoes a trigger.
// DMI/ADX describes trend/strength only. EMA20 and session VWAP are location
// context only and never delay/veto a trigger. PRICE STATE and dashboard
// Strategy/Chart Direction rows are removed. Only Daily Pivot P is drawn;
// S1/R1 remain in the combined DAILY table row. The selected developing Daily
// TR/range boundaries continue updating with incoming market bars, while P/S1/R1
// remain fixed from the previous completed native daily H/L/C until the next day.
// Alerts follow trigger transitions (BUY/SELL/WAIT), not EMA/VWAP/ADX/MOM6 gates.
// This remains a research indicator, not an order-entry engine. Native TradingView
// compile/live/reload acceptance is still required after import.
// v2.5.5 — 2026-09-16. Removes the NEXT REF display and its
// underlying nearest-reference calculation.
// v2.5.4 — 2026-09-16. Direction rules containing CVD now use the
// selected strategy/chart timeframe's live one-bar flow (Δ1), rather than
// the slower rolling Δ3 context. The CVD table is consolidated into one row:
// session CVD | Δ1 | Δ3 (or the user-selected context length). The separate
// Delta row is removed because it duplicated Δ1. Alerts also report Δ1.
// Δ3 remains context only and never blocks Trigger readiness.
// v2.5.3 fixed the recent-CVD window so it advances in
// the parent chart/strategy context instead of relying on a lower-timeframe
// endpoint array that could remain at 2/3 in live use. Delta and session CVD
// remain sourced from native 1m data. ΔN is now the sum of N consecutive,
// valid same-session parent-bar deltas, including the developing current bar.
// Also updates the alert payload version. Native TradingView compilation and
// live/reload acceptance remain required.
// v2.5.2 removed the VIEW row; source diagnostics remain in tooltips.
// v2.5.1 source, coverage and presentation update, not an
// optimized trading strategy. Existing MOM/EMA/DMI lengths, CVD signing rule,
// CVD lookback and median RVOL estimator are retained.
// Native index eligibility is fixed inside the source accumulator as well as
// at its call site. Never substitute SPY/QQQ for SPX/NDX.
// Delta, recent CVD change, session CVD and VWAP have independent validity.
// An unexplained source interval is NOT proof of a provider outage: there may
// be no trade, limited history or an unavailable feed field. Do not invent
// candles or volume. Only the affected coverage-dependent outputs are withheld.
// Normal Pine rollback handles developing minutes; no varip volume summation.
// Same-basis trigger calculations are checked, not cosmetically forced to agree.
// Closed alerts use prior strategy-bar snapshots; the display remains live.
// HOTFIX: analytics are aligned to the supplied native source-minute window,
// not to timenow. A delayed subscription is not missing data. Wall-clock age
// remains a display/notification safeguard only. No artificial delay offset,
// ETF fallback, fabricated candles or hidden cross-symbol substitution.
// Source timestamps identify bar-window boundaries, NOT exchange tick times.
// On delayed developing source minutes, RVOL uses the preceding completed
// minute for BOTH numerator and baseline; it never guesses sub-minute progress.
// Native TradingView compilation, session/real-time/reload tests remain required.

// ── 1. Decision architecture ───────────────────────────────────────────────
momLen = input.int(3, "Setup MOM block: bars", minval=1, maxval=50, group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Current setup block = close - close[momLen]. Confirmation uses the immediately preceding, non-overlapping block: close[momLen] - close[2*momLen].")
showSecondMOM = input.bool(true, "Show MOM6 context", group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Displays true cumulative MOM6 (close - close[6] at the default MOM3 setting). DECISION still confirms with the preceding non-overlapping 3-bar block internally.")
momMoveAtrFrac = input.float(0.02, "MOM wording deadband: ATR fraction", minval=0.0, maxval=0.50, step=0.01, group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Display wording only. It does not change raw calculations.")
emaLen = input.int(20, "EMA length", minval=1, maxval=200, group="1. Decision", display=display.none)
showHistogram = input.bool(false, "Optional MOM histogram", group="1. Decision", display=display.none)
showRiskGuide = input.bool(false, "Show ATR distance preview", group="1. Decision", display=display.none)

signalTF = input.timeframe("5", "Trigger timeframe", options=["1", "3", "5", "15", "30", "60"], group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Execution/setup basis. Keep it independent of chart zoom. Default 5m.")
trendMode = input.string("Auto from trigger", "Trend timeframe", options=["Auto from trigger", "Manual"], group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Overall-trend auto mapping for this intraday build: 1-3m trigger -> 15m; 5-15m -> 1h; 30-60m -> 4h. The trend always uses the previous completed trend bar. Swing mappings such as 4h->1D and 1D->1W belong in a separate swing model because this flow engine is limited to 1-60m triggers.")
manualTrendTF = input.timeframe("60", "Manual trend timeframe", options=["5", "15", "30", "60", "120", "240", "1D", "1W"], group="1. Decision", display=display.none)
reversalConfirmBars = input.int(2, "Opposite DECISION: consecutive closed bars", minval=1, maxval=3, group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="After an accepted CALL or PUT side, the opposite side must qualify on this many consecutive completed trigger bars before DECISION reverses. Default 2 prevents a direct CALL-to-PUT or PUT-to-CALL flip on one closed bar. Initial entries and repeated same-side decisions remain one-bar decisions.")
strictSessionMOM = input.bool(true, "Do not borrow prior-session MOM", group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Applies to the official trigger/DECISION basis. Supporting CHART MOM rows may span consecutive chart bars when the visible chart timeframe differs from the trigger TF, so 1h/4h/1D context remains usable.")

momAtrMin = input.float(0.10, "Minimum |MOM| / prior ATR", minval=0.0, maxval=2.0, step=0.01, group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Normalized setup threshold. Research input, not a certified optimum.")
deltaPctMin = input.float(0.08, "Minimum |estimated Delta| / bar volume", minval=0.0, maxval=1.0, step=0.01, group="1. Decision", display=display.none, tooltip="Participation threshold. Research input, not a certified optimum.")
adxEnter = input.float(20.0, "Trend ADX enter", minval=1.0, maxval=100.0, step=0.5, group="1. Decision", display=display.none)
adxExit = input.float(17.0, "Trend ADX exit", minval=1.0, maxval=100.0, step=0.5, group="1. Decision", display=display.none)
diSpreadMin = input.float(0.08, "Minimum normalized DI spread", minval=0.0, maxval=1.0, step=0.01, group="1. Decision", display=display.none)
maxEmaDistanceAtr = input.float(1.25, "No-chase distance from trigger EMA: ATR", minval=0.1, maxval=5.0, step=0.05, group="1. Decision", display=display.none)
requireBlockConfirm = input.bool(true, "Require preceding MOM block for DECISION", group="1. Decision", display=display.none)

// ── 2. Volume context ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
sessionZone = input.string("America/New_York", "Display time zone", options=["America/New_York", "America/Chicago", "Europe/London", "Etc/UTC", "Exchange"], group="2. Volume", display=display.none, tooltip="Display formatting only. Calculation sessions always follow the active TradingView chart session: RTH, extended, 24h or the selected provider-defined subsession.")
flowEstimator = input.string("Range-weighted", "Estimated Delta method", options=["Range-weighted", "Whole-bar sign (legacy)"], group="2. Volume", display=display.none, tooltip="Range-weighted uses V*(close-open)/(high-low), clipped to +/-V. Legacy assigns the whole 1m volume to one sign. Neither is bid/ask aggressor flow.")
rvolMode = input.string("Chart bar", "RVOL interval", options=["Chart bar", "Session cumulative"], group="2. Volume", display=display.none)
rvolDays = input.int(20, "RVOL prior sessions", minval=5, maxval=30, group="2. Volume", display=display.none)
minSamples = input.int(10, "RVOL minimum samples", minval=3, maxval=30, group="2. Volume", display=display.none)
showFlow = input.bool(true, "Show estimated session CVD / Delta", group="2. Volume", display=display.none)
cvdLen = input.int(3, "Estimated Delta context bars", minval=2, maxval=100, group="2. Volume", display=display.none)
allowIndexVolume = input.bool(true, "Use vendor INDEX volume", group="2. Volume", display=display.none)
indexFlowMode = input.string("Native index feed", "Cash-index Delta/CVD source", options=["Native index feed", "Off"], group="2. Volume", display=display.none)

// ── 3. Range, pivots and structure ─────────────────────────────────────────
diLen = input.int(14, "DMI length", minval=2, maxval=100, group="3. Structure", display=display.none)
adxSmooth = input.int(14, "ADX smoothing", minval=2, maxval=100, group="3. Structure", display=display.none)
showChartTRRow = input.bool(true, "Show Chart-TF trading range", group="3. Structure", display=display.none, tooltip="Current visible chart bar Low-High. This is a single-bar trading range, not a multi-bar lookback and not Wilder True Range.")
showHourlyTRRow = input.bool(true, "Show 1h trading range", group="3. Structure", display=display.none, tooltip="Current chart-selected-session 1h bar Low-High, accumulated causally from aligned chart bars. RTH follows RTH; extended follows extended; 24h follows 24h. No future high/low is borrowed.")
showPivotRow = input.bool(true, "Show Daily P / S1-R1 row", group="3. Structure", display=display.none)
trRangeColor = input.color(color.rgb(40, 110, 220), "TR row color", group="3. Structure", display=display.none)

// ── 4. Visuals ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
showEMA = input.bool(true, "Draw chart EMA", group="4. Display", display=display.none)
showPivots = input.bool(true, "Draw Daily Pivot P", group="4. Display", display=display.none)
pivotPColor = input.color(color.rgb(190, 145, 35), "Daily P color", group="4. Display", display=display.none)
showTable = input.bool(true, "Show dashboard", group="4. Display", display=display.none)
showPaneBadge = input.bool(true, "Show chart MOM badge", group="4. Display", display=display.none)
showEMArow = input.bool(true, "Show chart-TF EMA row", group="4. Display", display=display.none)
showRVOLrow = input.bool(true, "Show chart-TF RVOL row", group="4. Display", display=display.none)
momLineWidth = input.int(3, "MOM line width", minval=1, maxval=5, group="4. Display", display=display.none)
tableLocation = input.string("Top right", "Dashboard position", options=["Top right", "Middle right", "Bottom right", "Top left", "Bottom left"], group="4. Display", display=display.none)
tableSize = input.string("Small", "Dashboard font size", options=["Tiny", "Small", "Normal"], group="4. Display", display=display.none)
emaColor = input.color(color.orange, "EMA", group="4. Display", display=display.none)

// ── 5. Alerts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
liveAlerts = input.bool(false, "Enable alert() calls", group="5. Alerts", display=display.none)
alertTarget = input.string("DECISION", "Alert target", options=["DECISION", "RAW TRIGGER"], group="5. Alerts", display=display.none)
notifyWAIT = input.bool(false, "Also notify transitions to WAIT", group="5. Alerts", display=display.none)
alertMode = input.string("Live transitions", "Raw-trigger alert confirmation", options=["Live transitions", "Closed strategy bars"], group="5. Alerts", display=display.none)
alertCooldown = input.int(30, "Alert cooldown seconds", minval=15, maxval=600, group="5. Alerts", display=display.none)

string panelPosition = tableLocation == "Middle right" ? position.middle_right : tableLocation == "Bottom right" ? position.bottom_right : tableLocation == "Top left" ? position.top_left : tableLocation == "Bottom left" ? position.bottom_left : position.top_right
string panelTextSize = tableSize == "Tiny" ? size.tiny : tableSize == "Normal" ? size.normal : size.small
string zone = sessionZone == "Exchange" ? syminfo.timezone : sessionZone
string chartSessionName = syminfo.session
string chartSessionTicker = ticker.modify(syminfo.tickerid, chartSessionName)
int activeSessionId = time_tradingday
float signalSeconds = timeframe.in_seconds(signalTF)
string autoTrendTF = signalSeconds <= 180 ? "15" : signalSeconds <= 900 ? "60" : "240"
string trendTF = trendMode == "Auto from trigger" ? autoTrendTF : manualTrendTF
int momContextLen = momLen * 2
bool sessionTF = timeframe.isminutes and timeframe.multiplier <= 60
bool isIndex = syminfo.type == "index"
bool volumeAllowed = not isIndex or allowIndexVolume
bool nativeIndexFlow = isIndex and indexFlowMode == "Native index feed" and allowIndexVolume
string flowTicker = chartSessionTicker
bool flowIndexReference = isIndex and nativeIndexFlow
bool flowAllowed = not isIndex or nativeIndexFlow
bool sameDirectionBasis = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.main_period) == timeframe.in_seconds(signalTF)
bool closedAlertSupported = sessionTF and timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.main_period) <= timeframe.in_seconds(signalTF)
if barstate.isfirst
    if minSamples > rvolDays
        runtime.error("RVOL minimum samples cannot exceed history length.")
    if adxExit >= adxEnter
        runtime.error("ADX exit must be below ADX enter.")
    if not chart.is_standard
        runtime.error("Use standard time-based Candles or Bars, not synthetic charts.")
    if not (timeframe.isseconds or timeframe.isminutes or timeframe.isdaily or timeframe.isweekly or timeframe.ismonthly)
        runtime.error("Use a time-based chart, not a tick-interval chart.")

// ── Helpers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
f_num(float v) =>
    na(v) ? "N/A" : str.tostring(v, "0.00")
f_mom(float v) =>
    na(v) ? "N/A" : v != 0 and math.abs(v) < 0.00000001 ? (v > 0 ? "+<1e-8" : "-<1e-8") : (v > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(v, "0.00######")
f_price(float v) =>
    na(v) ? "N/A" : str.tostring(v, format.mintick)
f_vol(float v) =>
    na(v) ? "N/A" : (v > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(v, format.volume)
f_ratio(float v) =>
    na(v) ? "N/A" : (v > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(v, "0.00")
f_percent(float v) =>
    na(v) ? "N/A" : (v > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(v * 100.0, "0.0") + "%"
f_tf_text(string tf) =>
    tf == "60" ? "1h" : tf == "120" ? "2h" : tf == "240" ? "4h" : tf == "1D" ? "1D" : tf == "1W" ? "1W" : tf + "m"
f_mom_state(float momValue, float move) =>
    na(momValue) ? "WARMUP" : na(move) ? "CHANGE WARMUP" : move > 0 ? (momValue < 0 ? "↑ RECOVERING" : momValue > 0 ? "↑ STRENGTHENING" : "↑ IMPROVING") : move < 0 ? (momValue > 0 ? "↓ FADING" : momValue < 0 ? "↓ DETERIORATING" : "↓ WEAKENING") : "→ FLAT"
f_mom_display(float momValue, float move) =>
    f_mom(momValue) + " | " + f_mom_state(momValue, move)
f_bias(int d) =>
    d == 1 ? "BULL" : d == -1 ? "BEAR" : "WAIT"
f_color(int d) =>
    d == 1 ? color.teal : d == -1 ? color.red : color.gray
f_move_color(float d) =>
    na(d) ? color.gray : d > 0 ? color.green : d < 0 ? color.red : color.gray
f_direction_text(int direction, bool ready, string why) =>
    not ready ? (why == "OFF SESSION" ? "OFF SESSION" : "WAIT | " + why) : direction == 1 ? "RAW BULL" : direction == -1 ? "RAW BEAR" : "WAIT | " + why
f_trend_text(int regime, float adxValue, float spread, float emaSlope, string tf, string status) =>
    string slopeTxt = na(emaSlope) ? "" : emaSlope > 0 ? " | EMA↑" : emaSlope < 0 ? " | EMA↓" : " | EMA→"
    status != "OK" ? "WAIT | " + f_tf_text(tf) + " " + status : regime == 1 ? "BULL | " + f_tf_text(tf) + " CONF | ADX " + f_num(adxValue) + " | DI " + f_percent(spread) + slopeTxt : regime == -1 ? "BEAR | " + f_tf_text(tf) + " CONF | ADX " + f_num(adxValue) + " | DI " + f_percent(spread) + slopeTxt : "WAIT | " + f_tf_text(tf) + " CONF | ADX " + f_num(adxValue) + " | DI " + f_percent(spread)
f_trend_color(int regime) =>
    f_color(regime)
f_adx_strength(float adxValue, float adxMove, float plusValue, float minusValue, float spread) =>
    if na(adxValue) or na(plusValue) or na(minusValue)
        "N/A"
    else
        string side = spread > 0 ? "BULL" : spread < 0 ? "BEAR" : "NEUTRAL"
        string moveTxt = na(adxMove) ? "" : adxMove > 0 ? " | STRENGTH RISING" : adxMove < 0 ? " | STRENGTH EASING" : " | STRENGTH FLAT"
        side + " PRESSURE | ADX " + f_num(adxValue) + " | DI " + f_percent(spread) + moveTxt
f_trigger_text(int d, bool ready, string why, float momNorm, float deltaPct, string basis) =>
    not ready ? (why == "OFF SESSION" ? "OFF SESSION" : "WAIT | " + why) : d == 1 ? "RAW BULL | " + basis + " | MOM/ATR " + f_ratio(momNorm) + " | Δ% " + f_percent(deltaPct) : d == -1 ? "RAW BEAR | " + basis + " | MOM/ATR " + f_ratio(momNorm) + " | Δ% " + f_percent(deltaPct) : "WAIT | " + why
f_trigger_color(int d, bool ready) =>
    not ready ? color.gray : f_color(d)
f_confirmation_text(int triggerDirection, bool triggerReady, float currentBlock, float priorBlock, bool priorReady) =>
    not triggerReady or triggerDirection == 0 ? "WAIT | NO RAW TRIGGER" : not priorReady or na(priorBlock) ? "EARLY | PRIOR BLOCK WARMUP" : triggerDirection * priorBlock < 0 ? "CONFLICT | PRIOR BLOCK OPPOSITE" : priorBlock == 0 ? "EARLY | PRIOR BLOCK FLAT" : math.abs(currentBlock) >= math.abs(priorBlock) ? "CONFIRMED | MOMENTUM BUILDING" : "CONFIRMED | MOMENTUM FADING"
f_confirmation_ok(int triggerDirection, bool triggerReady, float priorBlock, bool priorReady) =>
    triggerReady and triggerDirection != 0 and priorReady and not na(priorBlock) and triggerDirection * priorBlock > 0
f_confirmation_color(int triggerDirection, bool triggerReady, float priorBlock, bool priorReady) =>
    not triggerReady or triggerDirection == 0 or not priorReady or na(priorBlock) ? color.gray : triggerDirection * priorBlock > 0 ? (triggerDirection == 1 ? color.teal : color.red) : color.orange
f_action_text(int action, string reason) =>
    action == 1 ? "CALL | " + reason : action == -1 ? "PUT | " + reason : "WAIT | " + reason
f_action_color(int action) =>
    f_color(action)

f_time(int t) =>
    na(t) ? "N/A" : str.format_time(t, "MM-dd HH:mm", zone)
f_symbol_name(string symbol) =>
    array<string> parts = str.split(symbol, ":")
    array.get(parts, array.size(parts) - 1)
f_row(table t, int row, string title, string value, color c, string tip) =>
    table.cell(t, 0, row, title, text_color=chart.fg_color, text_size=panelTextSize, text_halign=text.align_left, tooltip=tip)
    table.cell(t, 1, row, "  " + value + "  ", text_color=c, text_size=panelTextSize, text_halign=text.align_left, tooltip=tip)
f_true_range(float hi, float lo, float pc) =>
    na(hi) or na(lo) or na(pc) or hi < lo ? na : math.max(hi - lo, math.max(math.abs(hi - pc), math.abs(lo - pc)))
// Source-window checks never compare exchange bar time with execution time.
f_minute_in_parent(int sourceOpen, int sourceEnd, int parentOpen, int parentEnd) =>
    not na(sourceOpen) and not na(sourceEnd) and not na(parentOpen) and not na(parentEnd) and sourceEnd - sourceOpen == 60000 and sourceOpen >= parentOpen and sourceEnd <= parentEnd

f_same_source_minute(int sourceOpen, int sourceEnd, int stamp, int clockOpen, int clockEnd, int parentOpen, int parentEnd) =>
    f_minute_in_parent(sourceOpen, sourceEnd, parentOpen, parentEnd) and sourceOpen == clockOpen and sourceEnd == clockEnd and stamp == sourceEnd

// Age is only a notification/status policy. End is a minute-window bound,
// so this is not an exact feed-latency measurement or entitlement detector.
f_wall_fresh(int sourceOpen, int sourceEnd, int nowAt) =>
    not na(sourceOpen) and not na(sourceEnd) and sourceEnd - sourceOpen == 60000 and sourceOpen <= nowAt and sourceEnd >= nowAt - 90000

type VolumeSession
    array<float> cumulative
    array<int> observed

const int MAX_SELECTED_SESSION_MINUTES = 1500

// Prefix entries in empty clock slots are bookkeeping, NOT synthetic candles.
// Session identity follows the active named chart session. `time_tradingday` is
// stable across overnight portions, while `session.isfirstbar` verifies that the
// requested 1m history actually observed the selected session's first bar.
// A separate observed count validates every RVOL comparison window.
f_volume_packet(simple bool computeRVOL, simple string basisTF) =>
    int sessionId = time_tradingday
    bool inside = not na(sessionId)
    var array<VolumeSession> history = array.new<VolumeSession>(0)
    var array<float> today = array.new<float>(0)
    var array<int> observed = array.new<int>(0)
    var array<float> samples = array.new<float>(0)
    var int active = na
    var int sessionOpen = na
    var bool sessionStartObserved = false
    var bool sessionGood = false
    var int lastSlot = -1
    var int previousClose = na
    var int observedCount = 0
    var int selectedSessionEnd = na
    var float cumV = 0.0
    var float cumPV = 0.0
    var float vw = na
    var float rv = na
    var int n = 0
    var int asof = na
    var string failure = "NO SOURCE HISTORY"
    var string vs = "NO SOURCE HISTORY"
    var string rs = "NO SOURCE HISTORY"
    if inside
        bool newSession = na(active) or active != sessionId
        if newSession
            // Archive only sessions whose true selected-session start was seen.
            // Individual RVOL windows still pass their own observed-count checks.
            if computeRVOL and not na(active) and sessionStartObserved and observedCount > 0 and cumV > 0
                array.push(history, VolumeSession.new(array.copy(today), array.copy(observed)))
                if array.size(history) > rvolDays
                    array.shift(history)
            active := sessionId
            sessionOpen := time
            sessionStartObserved := session.isfirstbar
            sessionGood := sessionStartObserved
            lastSlot := -1
            previousClose := na
            observedCount := 0
            selectedSessionEnd := na
            cumV := 0.0
            cumPV := 0.0
            failure := sessionGood ? "OK" : "SESSION START NOT OBSERVED"
            if computeRVOL
                today := array.new<float>(0)
                observed := array.new<int>(0)
        int slot = not na(sessionOpen) ? int((time - sessionOpen) / 60000) : -1
        bool minuteShape = not na(time_close) and time_close - time == 60000
        bool pricesOK = not na(open) and not na(high) and not na(low) and not na(close) and high >= math.max(open, close) and low <= math.min(open, close) and high >= low
        bool volumeOK = not na(volume) and volume >= 0
        bool slotOK = slot >= 0 and slot < MAX_SELECTED_SESSION_MINUTES and slot > lastSlot
        bool continuityOK = newSession or (not na(previousClose) and time == previousClose)
        bool minuteOK = minuteShape and pricesOK and volumeOK and slotOK
        if not continuityOK
            sessionGood := false
            failure := "SOURCE COVERAGE NOT VERIFIED"
        if not minuteOK
            sessionGood := false
            failure := not slotOK ? "SOURCE SLOT CHECK" : not minuteShape ? "SOURCE BAR CHECK" : not volumeOK ? "NO USABLE VOLUME" : "INVALID OHLC"
        // Grow to the actual selected-session clock offset. Missing slots retain
        // cumulative bookkeeping only; observed counts do not invent candles.
        if computeRVOL and slotOK
            while array.size(today) <= slot
                array.push(today, cumV)
                array.push(observed, observedCount)
        if minuteOK
            cumV += volume
            cumPV += hlc3 * volume
            observedCount += 1
        if computeRVOL and slotOK
            array.set(today, slot, cumV)
            array.set(observed, slot, observedCount)
        previousClose := time_close
        lastSlot := slot
        asof := time_close
        if session.islastbar and not barstate.isrealtime
            selectedSessionEnd := time_close
        bool sessionCompleteSoFar = sessionGood and minuteOK and observedCount == slot + 1
        vw := sessionCompleteSoFar and cumV > 0 ? cumPV / cumV : na
        vs := not sessionCompleteSoFar ? failure : cumV <= 0 ? "ZERO SESSION VOLUME" : "OK"
        rv := na
        n := 0
        rs := computeRVOL ? "INTERVAL NOT ALIGNED" : "OFF"
        if computeRVOL and slotOK
            int parent = time(basisTF)
            int intervalStart = rvolMode == "Chart bar" ? math.max(parent, sessionOpen) : sessionOpen
            int priorSlot = int((intervalStart - sessionOpen) / 60000) - 1
            bool aligned = not na(parent) and not na(sessionOpen) and intervalStart >= sessionOpen and intervalStart <= time and (intervalStart - sessionOpen) % 60000 == 0
            if aligned
                // A delayed source minute can still be developing even when wall
                // time is later. Do not infer entitlement or completion from age.
                bool elapsedKnown = not barstate.isrealtime or (timenow >= time and timenow < time_close)
                bool closedSample = not elapsedKnown
                int sampleSlot = slot - (closedSample ? 1 : 0)
                bool previousBarSample = closedSample and rvolMode == "Chart bar" and timeframe.in_seconds(basisTF) == 60 and sampleSlot >= 0
                int samplePriorSlot = previousBarSample ? sampleSlot - 1 : priorSlot
                bool haveSample = sampleSlot >= 0 and sampleSlot > samplePriorSlot and sampleSlot < array.size(today)
                if haveSample
                    float beforeNow = samplePriorSlot >= 0 ? array.get(today, samplePriorSlot) : 0.0
                    int beforeCount = samplePriorSlot >= 0 ? array.get(observed, samplePriorSlot) : 0
                    float sampleSum = array.get(today, sampleSlot)
                    int sampleCount = array.get(observed, sampleSlot)
                    int requiredCount = sampleSlot - samplePriorSlot
                    bool currentComplete = (closedSample or minuteOK) and not na(beforeCount) and not na(sampleCount) and sampleCount - beforeCount == requiredCount
                    float currentInterval = currentComplete ? sampleSum - beforeNow : na
                    float progress = closedSample or not barstate.isrealtime ? 1.0 : math.max(0.0, math.min(1.0, float(timenow - time) / 60000.0))
                    array.clear(samples)
                    if array.size(history) > 0
                        for d = 0 to array.size(history) - 1
                            VolumeSession prior = array.get(history, d)
                            int priorSize = array.size(prior.cumulative)
                            bool priorHasWindow = sampleSlot < priorSize and (samplePriorSlot < 0 or samplePriorSlot < priorSize)
                            if priorHasWindow
                                float full = array.get(prior.cumulative, sampleSlot)
                                float beforeMinute = sampleSlot > 0 ? array.get(prior.cumulative, sampleSlot - 1) : 0.0
                                float beforeInterval = samplePriorSlot >= 0 ? array.get(prior.cumulative, samplePriorSlot) : 0.0
                                int countAtEnd = array.get(prior.observed, sampleSlot)
                                int countBefore = samplePriorSlot >= 0 ? array.get(prior.observed, samplePriorSlot) : 0
                                bool completeWindow = not na(countAtEnd) and not na(countBefore) and countAtEnd - countBefore == requiredCount
                                if completeWindow and not na(full) and not na(beforeMinute) and not na(beforeInterval) and full >= beforeMinute and beforeMinute >= beforeInterval
                                    float matched = beforeMinute + (full - beforeMinute) * progress - beforeInterval
                                    if matched >= 0
                                        array.push(samples, matched)
                    n := array.size(samples)
                    float baseline = n >= minSamples ? array.median(samples) : na
                    rv := not na(currentInterval) and currentInterval >= 0 and not na(baseline) and baseline > 0 ? currentInterval / baseline : na
                    rs := not currentComplete ? "INTERVAL COVERAGE NOT VERIFIED" : n < minSamples ? "SAMPLES " + str.tostring(n) + "/" + str.tostring(minSamples) : na(baseline) or baseline <= 0 ? "ZERO BASELINE" : previousBarSample ? "OK | PREV BAR" : closedSample ? "OK | CLOSED SAMPLE" : "OK"
                else
                    rs := "WAIT CLOSED SOURCE MINUTE"
    [vw, rv, n, active, asof, vs, rs, time, time_close, selectedSessionEnd]

// Independent native 1m flow accumulator for each requested parent basis.
// Range-weighted mode reduces the all-or-nothing +/-V distortion. Legacy mode
// retains the old whole-bar sign estimator, but polarity is reset at session open.
f_flow_packet(simple string basisTF) =>
    bool canFlow = syminfo.type != "index" or (allowIndexVolume and indexFlowMode == "Native index feed")
    int sessionId = time_tradingday
    bool inside = not na(sessionId)
    int currentParent = time(basisTF)
    int currentParentEnd = time_close(basisTF)
    var int active = na
    var int previousCloseTime = na
    var float previousPriceClose = na
    var int polarity = 0
    var bool sessionGood = false
    var string sessionFailure = "NO SOURCE HISTORY"
    var float cumV = 0.0
    var float cv = 0.0
    var float unknown = 0.0
    var int parentOpen = na
    var int parentEnd = na
    var int parentMinuteCount = 0
    var bool parentGood = false
    var string parentFailure = "NO SOURCE HISTORY"
    var float dv = 0.0
    var float parentV = 0.0
    var float parentUnknown = 0.0
    var int asof = na
    if inside
        bool newSession = na(active) or active != sessionId
        if newSession
            active := sessionId
            sessionGood := session.isfirstbar
            sessionFailure := sessionGood ? "OK" : "SESSION START NOT OBSERVED"
            previousCloseTime := na
            previousPriceClose := na
            polarity := 0
            cumV := 0.0
            cv := 0.0
            unknown := 0.0
            parentOpen := currentParent
            parentEnd := currentParentEnd
            parentMinuteCount := 0
            parentGood := not na(currentParent) and time == currentParent
            parentFailure := parentGood ? "OK" : "INTERVAL START NOT OBSERVED"
            dv := 0.0
            parentV := 0.0
            parentUnknown := 0.0
        else if currentParent != parentOpen
            parentOpen := currentParent
            parentEnd := currentParentEnd
            parentMinuteCount := 0
            parentGood := not na(currentParent) and time == currentParent
            parentFailure := parentGood ? "OK" : "INTERVAL START NOT OBSERVED"
            dv := 0.0
            parentV := 0.0
            parentUnknown := 0.0
        if not newSession and (na(previousCloseTime) or time != previousCloseTime)
            sessionGood := false
            sessionFailure := "SOURCE COVERAGE NOT VERIFIED"
            if time != currentParent
                parentGood := false
                parentFailure := "INTERVAL COVERAGE NOT VERIFIED"
        bool parentAligned = not na(currentParent) and not na(currentParentEnd) and currentParent <= time and currentParentEnd >= time_close
        bool minuteShape = not na(time_close) and time_close - time == 60000
        bool pricesOK = not na(open) and not na(high) and not na(low) and not na(close) and high >= math.max(open, close) and low <= math.min(open, close) and high >= low
        bool volumeOK = not na(volume) and volume >= 0
        bool minuteOK = parentAligned and minuteShape and pricesOK and volumeOK
        if not minuteOK
            sessionGood := false
            parentGood := false
            sessionFailure := not parentAligned ? "PARENT ALIGNMENT" : not minuteShape ? "SOURCE BAR CHECK" : not volumeOK ? "NO USABLE VOLUME" : "INVALID OHLC"
            parentFailure := sessionFailure
        previousCloseTime := time_close
        asof := time_close
        if minuteOK
            int resolvedPolarity = close > open ? 1 : close < open ? -1 : not na(previousPriceClose) and close > previousPriceClose ? 1 : not na(previousPriceClose) and close < previousPriceClose ? -1 : 0
            if resolvedPolarity != 0
                polarity := resolvedPolarity
            float signedV = 0.0
            if flowEstimator == "Range-weighted"
                float span = high - low
                float weight = span > 0 ? math.max(-1.0, math.min(1.0, (close - open) / span)) : float(resolvedPolarity)
                signedV := volume * weight
            else
                signedV := polarity * volume
                if polarity == 0 and volume > 0
                    unknown += volume
                    parentUnknown += volume
            cumV += volume
            cv += signedV
            dv += signedV
            parentV += volume
            parentMinuteCount += 1
            previousPriceClose := close
    bool legacyUnknown = flowEstimator == "Whole-bar sign (legacy)"
    bool deltaOK = canFlow and parentGood and (not legacyUnknown or parentUnknown == 0) and parentMinuteCount > 0 and parentV > 0
    bool sessionOK = canFlow and sessionGood and (not legacyUnknown or unknown == 0) and cumV > 0
    float currentCvd = sessionOK ? cv : na
    float currentDelta = deltaOK ? dv : na
    float currentParentVolume = deltaOK ? parentV : na
    string status = not canFlow ? "INDEX FLOW OFF" : not sessionGood ? sessionFailure : legacyUnknown and unknown > 0 ? "UNCLASSIFIED VOLUME" : cumV <= 0 ? "ZERO SESSION VOLUME" : "OK"
    string deltaState = not canFlow ? "INDEX FLOW OFF" : not parentGood ? parentFailure : legacyUnknown and parentUnknown > 0 ? "UNCLASSIFIED VOLUME" : parentMinuteCount == 0 ? "NO SOURCE HISTORY" : parentV <= 0 ? "ZERO BAR VOLUME" : "OK"
    [currentCvd, currentDelta, currentParentVolume, active, asof, parentOpen, status, deltaState, time, time_close]

// Confirmed trend packet for chart TF <= Trend TF. The [1] offset plus
// lookahead_on returns the previous completed trend bar without repainting.
f_trend_packet_confirmed() =>
    [pdi, mdi, ax] = ta.dmi(diLen, adxSmooth)
    float e = ta.ema(close, emaLen)
    float spread = (pdi + mdi) > 0 ? (pdi - mdi) / (pdi + mdi) : 0.0
    bool newSession = not na(time_tradingday[1]) and time_tradingday != time_tradingday[1]
    var bool strengthActive = false
    if newSession
        strengthActive := false
    strengthActive := strengthActive ? ax >= adxExit : ax >= adxEnter
    int regime = strengthActive and math.abs(spread) >= diSpreadMin ? (spread > 0 ? 1 : -1) : 0
    [regime[1], pdi[1], mdi[1], ax[1], ax[2], spread[1], e[1], e[2], close[1], time[1], time_close[1], time_tradingday[1]]

// When Trend TF is lower than the visible chart TF, request.security() must use
// lookahead_off so historical and realtime bars both return the last intrabar.
// The requested-context calculation then selects the latest fully completed,
// full-duration Trend-TF bar. A shortened final RTH fragment is skipped.
f_trend_packet_latest_full(simple int expectedMs) =>
    [pdi, mdi, ax] = ta.dmi(diLen, adxSmooth)
    float e = ta.ema(close, emaLen)
    float spread = (pdi + mdi) > 0 ? (pdi - mdi) / (pdi + mdi) : 0.0
    bool newSession = not na(time_tradingday[1]) and time_tradingday != time_tradingday[1]
    var bool strengthActive = false
    if newSession
        strengthActive := false
    strengthActive := strengthActive ? ax >= adxExit : ax >= adxEnter
    int regime = strengthActive and math.abs(spread) >= diSpreadMin ? (spread > 0 ? 1 : -1) : 0
    bool fullDuration = not na(time_close) and time_close - time == expectedMs
    bool completed = not barstate.isrealtime or time_close <= timenow
    bool eligible = fullDuration and completed
    int outRegime = ta.valuewhen(eligible, regime, 0)
    float outPdi = ta.valuewhen(eligible, pdi, 0)
    float outMdi = ta.valuewhen(eligible, mdi, 0)
    float outAdx = ta.valuewhen(eligible, ax, 0)
    float outAdxPrev = ta.valuewhen(eligible, ax, 1)
    float outSpread = ta.valuewhen(eligible, spread, 0)
    float outEma = ta.valuewhen(eligible, e, 0)
    float outEmaPrev = ta.valuewhen(eligible, e, 1)
    float outClose = ta.valuewhen(eligible, close, 0)
    int outStart = ta.valuewhen(eligible, time, 0)
    int outEnd = ta.valuewhen(eligible, time_close, 0)
    int outSession = ta.valuewhen(eligible, time_tradingday, 0)
    [outRegime, outPdi, outMdi, outAdx, outAdxPrev, outSpread, outEma, outEmaPrev, outClose, outStart, outEnd, outSession]

float trendSeconds = timeframe.in_seconds(trendTF)
int trendExpectedMs = int(trendSeconds * 1000.0)
float chartRequestSeconds = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.main_period)
bool trendIsLowerThanChart = not na(chartRequestSeconds) and chartRequestSeconds > trendSeconds

int requestedTrendRegime = 0
float trendPlusDI = na
float trendMinusDI = na
float trendADX = na
float trendADXPrev = na
float trendDISpread = na
float trendEMA = na
float trendEMAPrev = na
float trendClose = na
int trendStart = na
int trendEnd = na
int trendSessionId = na

if trendIsLowerThanChart
    [tr, tp, tm, tax, taxp, tspread, te, tep, tc, ts, tend, tsid] = request.security(chartSessionTicker, trendTF, f_trend_packet_latest_full(trendExpectedMs), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=1500)
    requestedTrendRegime := tr
    trendPlusDI := tp
    trendMinusDI := tm
    trendADX := tax
    trendADXPrev := taxp
    trendDISpread := tspread
    trendEMA := te
    trendEMAPrev := tep
    trendClose := tc
    trendStart := ts
    trendEnd := tend
    trendSessionId := tsid
else
    [tr, tp, tm, tax, taxp, tspread, te, tep, tc, ts, tend, tsid] = request.security(chartSessionTicker, trendTF, f_trend_packet_confirmed(), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=1500)
    requestedTrendRegime := tr
    trendPlusDI := tp
    trendMinusDI := tm
    trendADX := tax
    trendADXPrev := taxp
    trendDISpread := tspread
    trendEMA := te
    trendEMAPrev := tep
    trendClose := tc
    trendStart := ts
    trendEnd := tend
    trendSessionId := tsid

float trendEMASlope = trendEMA - trendEMAPrev
bool trendIntraday = trendSeconds < 86400
bool trendDurationOK = not trendIntraday or (not na(trendStart) and not na(trendEnd) and trendEnd - trendStart == trendExpectedMs)
bool trendSameActiveSession = not trendIntraday or (not na(trendSessionId) and not na(activeSessionId) and trendSessionId == activeSessionId)
string trendStatus = na(trendADX) or na(trendDISpread) or na(trendEMA) or na(trendClose) ? "WARMUP" : not trendDurationOK ? "PARTIAL BAR BLOCKED" : not trendSameActiveSession ? "CURRENT CHART SESSION WARMUP" : "OK"
bool trendDataReady = trendStatus == "OK"
int trendRegime = trendDataReady ? requestedTrendRegime : 0

// Core trigger packet. Price setup and estimated participation use the same
// parent timeframe and the active named TradingView chart session.
f_core(simple string basisTF, simple bool enforceSessionWindows) =>
    float basisSeconds = timeframe.in_seconds(basisTF)
    bool supported = not na(basisSeconds) and basisSeconds >= 60 and basisSeconds <= 86400
    int feedOpen = na
    int feedEnd = na
    if supported
        [clockOpen, clockEnd] = request.security(chartSessionTicker, "1", [time, time_close], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=50000)
        feedOpen := clockOpen
        feedEnd := clockEnd
    bool clockInParent = f_minute_in_parent(feedOpen, feedEnd, time, time_close)
    int sessionId = time_tradingday
    bool inside = not na(sessionId)
    bool priceBarOK = not na(time_close) and time_close > time and not na(close)

    bool currentBlockSameSession = not enforceSessionWindows or (not na(sessionId[momLen]) and sessionId == sessionId[momLen])
    bool priorBlockSameSession = not enforceSessionWindows or (not na(sessionId[momContextLen]) and sessionId == sessionId[momLen] and sessionId == sessionId[momContextLen])
    float m = currentBlockSameSession ? close - close[momLen] : na
    float priorBlock = priorBlockSameSession ? close[momLen] - close[momContextLen] : na
    float e = ta.ema(close, emaLen)
    float atrBase = ta.atr(14)[1]
    float momNorm = not na(m) and not na(atrBase) and atrBase > 0 ? m / atrBase : na
    float emaDistanceAtr = not na(e) and not na(atrBase) and atrBase > 0 ? (close - e) / atrBase : na
    [pdi, mdi, ax] = ta.dmi(diLen, adxSmooth)
    bool mOK = not na(m) and not na(momNorm)
    bool priorOK = not na(priorBlock)

    float cv = na
    float dv = na
    float parentV = na
    float deltaPct = na
    float change = na
    float changePct = na
    int historyBars = 0
    int flowAsOf = na
    bool aligned = false
    string flowStatus = not supported ? "USE 1m-1D" : not flowAllowed ? (isIndex ? (indexFlowMode == "Off" ? "INDEX FLOW OFF" : "INDEX VOLUME OFF") : "FLOW OFF") : "NO SOURCE HISTORY"
    string deltaStatus = flowStatus
    string changeStatus = flowStatus
    if supported and flowAllowed
        [fc, fd, fv, fs, fa, fp, fst, fdt, flowOpen, flowEnd] = request.security(flowTicker, "1", f_flow_packet(basisTF), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=50000)
        bool timeOK = inside and fs == sessionId and fp == time and f_same_source_minute(flowOpen, flowEnd, fa, feedOpen, feedEnd, time, time_close)
        if timeOK
            cv := fc
            dv := fd
            parentV := fv
            deltaPct := not na(fv) and fv > 0 ? fd / fv : na
            flowAsOf := fa
            aligned := true
            flowStatus := fst
            deltaStatus := fdt
        else
            flowStatus := na(fs) ? "NO SOURCE HISTORY" : fs != sessionId ? "SESSION NOT ALIGNED" : fp != time ? "SOURCE INTERVAL NOT ALIGNED" : "SOURCE SYNC PENDING"
            deltaStatus := flowStatus

    var int cleanFlowBars = 0
    bool sameFlowSession = not enforceSessionWindows or (not na(sessionId[1]) and sessionId == sessionId[1])
    bool cleanFlowBar = aligned and not na(dv) and not na(parentV) and parentV > 0
    cleanFlowBars := cleanFlowBar ? (sameFlowSession ? nz(cleanFlowBars[1]) + 1 : 1) : 0
    historyBars := math.min(cleanFlowBars, cvdLen)
    bool changeWindowOK = cleanFlowBars >= cvdLen
    float rollingChange = 0.0
    float rollingVolume = 0.0
    if changeWindowOK
        for offset = 0 to cvdLen - 1
            float deltaPart = dv[offset]
            float volumePart = parentV[offset]
            bool sameWindowSession = not enforceSessionWindows or (not na(sessionId[offset]) and sessionId[offset] == sessionId)
            if na(deltaPart) or na(volumePart) or volumePart <= 0 or not sameWindowSession
                changeWindowOK := false
            else
                rollingChange += deltaPart
                rollingVolume += volumePart
    change := changeWindowOK ? rollingChange : na
    changePct := changeWindowOK and rollingVolume > 0 ? rollingChange / rollingVolume : na
    changeStatus := not aligned ? flowStatus : not cleanFlowBar ? deltaStatus : cleanFlowBars < cvdLen ? "Δ" + str.tostring(cvdLen) + " WARMUP " + str.tostring(cleanFlowBars) + "/" + str.tostring(cvdLen) : not changeWindowOK ? "CVD WINDOW CHECK" : "OK"

    bool flowOK = aligned and not na(deltaPct)
    bool ready = supported and inside and priceBarOK and mOK and flowOK
    bool bull = ready and momNorm >= momAtrMin and deltaPct >= deltaPctMin
    bool bear = ready and momNorm <= -momAtrMin and deltaPct <= -deltaPctMin
    int direction = bull ? 1 : bear ? -1 : 0
    string why = not supported ? "USE 1m-1D" : not priceBarOK ? "PRICE BAR CHECK" : not currentBlockSameSession ? "OPENING MOM WARMUP" : na(atrBase) or atrBase <= 0 ? "ATR WARMUP" : not mOK ? "MOM WARMUP" : not flowOK ? deltaStatus : math.abs(momNorm) < momAtrMin ? "MOM/ATR BELOW THRESHOLD" : math.abs(deltaPct) < deltaPctMin ? "Δ% BELOW THRESHOLD" : momNorm * deltaPct < 0 ? "MOM / Δ% CONFLICT" : "THRESHOLDS NOT ALIGNED"
    [direction, ready, why, close, close[momLen], close[momContextLen], m, priorBlock, momNorm, e, atrBase, emaDistanceAtr, pdi, mdi, ax, m[1], priorBlock[1], ax[1], time, time_close, cv, dv, parentV, deltaPct, change, changePct, historyBars, flowAsOf, flowStatus, aligned, mOK, priorOK, sessionId, deltaStatus, changeStatus, feedOpen, feedEnd]

// Explicit trigger-timeframe snapshot.
[strategyDirection, strategyReady, strategyWhy, strategyClose, strategyRef, strategyRef2, strategyMOM, strategyPriorMOM, strategyMOMNorm, strategyEMA, strategyATR, strategyEMADistance, strategyPlusDI, strategyMinusDI, strategyADX, strategyMPrev, strategyPriorMPrev, strategyADXPrev, strategyStart, strategyEnd, strategyCVD, strategyDelta, strategyParentVolume, strategyDeltaPct, strategyChange, strategyChangePct, strategyHistory, strategyAsOf, strategyFlowStatus, strategyAligned, strategyMOMReady, strategyPriorReady, strategySession, strategyDeltaStatus, strategyChangeStatus, strategyFeedStart, strategyFeedEnd] = request.security(chartSessionTicker, signalTF, f_core(signalTF, strictSessionMOM), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=1500)

// Local chart context packet. It drives supporting rows only; it never drives TREND or DECISION.
// Preserve exact trigger/chart parity when both bases match; otherwise chart MOM
// and chart multi-bar flow may span sessions so 1h/4h/1D context remains usable.
bool chartEnforceSessionWindows = sameDirectionBasis and strictSessionMOM
[chartDirection, chartReady, chartWhy, localClose, momRef, mom2Ref, mom, priorMom, chartMOMNorm, ema, localATR, localEMADistance, plusDI, minusDI, adx, momPrevious, priorMomPrevious, adxPrevious, localStart, localEnd, sessionCVD, barDelta, chartParentVolume, chartDeltaPct, cvdRecentChange, chartChangePct, cvdHistoryBars, flowAsOf, flowStatus, flowClockAligned, momReady, priorMomReady, localSession, deltaStatus, changeStatus, localFeedStart, localFeedEnd] = f_core(timeframe.main_period, chartEnforceSessionWindows)
float momMoveBand = momMoveAtrFrac == 0 ? 0.0 : not na(localATR) ? math.max(syminfo.mintick, localATR * momMoveAtrFrac) : syminfo.mintick
float mom6 = not na(mom) and not na(priorMom) ? mom + priorMom : na
float mom6Previous = not na(momPrevious) and not na(priorMomPrevious) ? momPrevious + priorMomPrevious : na
float momMoveRaw = mom - momPrevious
float mom6MoveRaw = mom6 - mom6Previous
float momArrowChange = na(momMoveRaw) ? na : math.abs(momMoveRaw) <= momMoveBand ? 0.0 : momMoveRaw
float mom6ArrowChange = na(mom6MoveRaw) ? na : math.abs(mom6MoveRaw) <= momMoveBand ? 0.0 : mom6MoveRaw
bool openRealtimeBar = barstate.isrealtime
string tfText = timeframe.isminutes ? str.tostring(timeframe.multiplier) + "m" : timeframe.period
string strategyTFText = f_tf_text(signalTF)
string trendTFText = f_tf_text(trendTF)
string flowName = syminfo.ticker
string flowTableSuffix = isIndex ? " " + flowName + "*" : ""

bool sameBasisMismatch = sameDirectionBasis and strategyStart == localStart and (strategyDirection != chartDirection or strategyReady != chartReady or (not na(strategyMOM) and not na(mom) and math.abs(strategyMOM - mom) > 1e-8) or (na(strategyDelta) != na(barDelta)) or (not na(strategyDelta) and not na(barDelta) and math.abs(strategyDelta - barDelta) > math.max(1e-8, math.abs(barDelta) * 1e-10)) or (na(strategyDeltaPct) != na(chartDeltaPct)) or (not na(strategyDeltaPct) and not na(chartDeltaPct) and math.abs(strategyDeltaPct - chartDeltaPct) > 1e-10))

// Trigger-session identity remains independent because RAW TRIGGER and DECISION
// stay on signalTF even when the visible chart timeframe changes. All identities
// use the active named chart session's `time_tradingday`.
bool strategyFeedAligned = f_minute_in_parent(strategyFeedStart, strategyFeedEnd, strategyStart, strategyEnd)
int expectedSessionId = activeSessionId
bool strategySourceInSession = strategyFeedAligned and not na(strategySession) and strategySession == expectedSessionId

// Dashboard RVOL/VWAP context follows the visible chart timeframe.
bool chartFeedAligned = f_minute_in_parent(localFeedStart, localFeedEnd, localStart, localEnd)
int expectedChartSessionId = activeSessionId
bool chartSourceInSession = chartFeedAligned and not na(localSession) and localSession == expectedChartSessionId
int volumeSourceStart = na
int volumeSourceEnd = na
int volumePacketStamp = na
float sessionVWAP = na
float rvol = na
int rvolN = 0
bool volumeIsReference = false
bool vwapInThisBar = false
string vwapStatus = not volumeAllowed ? "INDEX VOLUME OFF" : "NO SOURCE HISTORY"
string rvolStatus = vwapStatus
if volumeAllowed
    [v, rv, n, sid, stamp, vs, rs, volumeOpen, volumeEnd, sourceSelectedSessionEnd] = request.security(chartSessionTicker, "1", f_volume_packet(true, timeframe.main_period), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=50000)
    volumeSourceStart := volumeOpen
    volumeSourceEnd := volumeEnd
    volumePacketStamp := stamp
    bool same = sid == expectedChartSessionId
    bool ref = same and not chartSourceInSession and not na(sourceSelectedSessionEnd) and stamp == sourceSelectedSessionEnd
    bool fresh = same and chartSourceInSession and f_same_source_minute(volumeOpen, volumeEnd, stamp, localFeedStart, localFeedEnd, localStart, localEnd)
    if fresh or ref
        sessionVWAP := v
        rvol := rv
        rvolN := n
        volumeIsReference := ref
        vwapInThisBar := fresh and not na(v)
        vwapStatus := vs
        rvolStatus := rs
    else
        vwapStatus := not same ? (na(sid) ? "NO SOURCE HISTORY" : "OTHER SESSION") : "SOURCE SYNC PENDING"
        rvolStatus := vwapStatus

// Previous completed trigger bar for stable DECISION and optional closed RAW alerts.
f_closed_strategy(simple string basisTF) =>
    [d, ok, reason, px, ref1, ref2, m, priorBlock, momNorm, e, atrBase, emaDist, pdi, mdi, ax, pm, pPrior, pax, beginAt, endAt, cv, dv, parentV, deltaPct, change, changePct, count, stamp, fs, aligned, mok, priorOK, sid, ds, cs, feedOpen, feedEnd] = f_core(basisTF, strictSessionMOM)
    [d[1], ok[1], reason[1], px[1], m[1], priorBlock[1], momNorm[1], e[1], atrBase[1], emaDist[1], dv[1], deltaPct[1], changePct[1], beginAt[1], endAt[1], sid[1], priorOK[1], feedOpen[1], feedEnd[1]]

int closedDirection = 0
bool closedReady = false
string closedWhy = "CLOSED DECISION UNAVAILABLE"
float closedPrice = na
float closedMOM = na
float closedPriorMOM = na
float closedMOMNorm = na
float closedEMA = na
float closedATR = na
float closedEMADistance = na
float closedDelta1 = na
float closedDeltaPct = na
float closedChangePct = na
int closedStart = na
int closedEnd = na
int closedSession = na
bool closedPriorReady = false
int closedFeedStart = na
int closedFeedEnd = na
bool closedDecisionSupported = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.main_period) <= timeframe.in_seconds(signalTF)
if closedDecisionSupported
    [cd, cr, cw, cp, cm, cpm, cmn, ce, ca, ced, cdelta, cdp, ccp, cb, cend, csid, cpriorok, cfeedopen, cfeedend] = request.security(chartSessionTicker, signalTF, f_closed_strategy(signalTF), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=1500)
    closedDirection := cd
    closedReady := cr
    closedWhy := cw
    closedPrice := cp
    closedMOM := cm
    closedPriorMOM := cpm
    closedMOMNorm := cmn
    closedEMA := ce
    closedATR := ca
    closedEMADistance := ced
    closedDelta1 := cdelta
    closedDeltaPct := cdp
    closedChangePct := ccp
    closedStart := cb
    closedEnd := cend
    closedSession := csid
    closedPriorReady := cpriorok
    closedFeedStart := cfeedopen
    closedFeedEnd := cfeedend

// Official DECISION is always based on the previous completed trigger bar.
// RAW TRIGGER above remains the only live/aggressive preview.
int decisionDirection = closedDirection
bool decisionReady = closedReady
string decisionWhy = closedWhy
float decisionPrice = closedPrice
float decisionMOM = closedMOM
float decisionPriorMOM = closedPriorMOM
float decisionMOMNorm = closedMOMNorm
float decisionEMA = closedEMA
float decisionATR = closedATR
float decisionEMADistance = closedEMADistance
float decisionDelta1 = closedDelta1
float decisionDeltaPct = closedDeltaPct
float decisionChangePct = closedChangePct
int decisionStart = closedStart
int decisionEnd = closedEnd
int decisionSession = closedSession
bool decisionPriorReady = closedPriorReady
bool actionBasisAvailable = closedDecisionSupported
bool decisionSameActiveSession = not na(decisionSession) and decisionSession == expectedSessionId
string decisionConfirmation = f_confirmation_text(decisionDirection, decisionReady, decisionMOM, decisionPriorMOM, decisionPriorReady)
bool blockConfirmOK = f_confirmation_ok(decisionDirection, decisionReady, decisionPriorMOM, decisionPriorReady)
bool notExtended = na(decisionEMADistance) ? false : decisionDirection == 1 ? decisionEMADistance <= maxEmaDistanceAtr : decisionDirection == -1 ? decisionEMADistance >= -maxEmaDistanceAtr : false

// First resolve the completed-bar candidate without persistence/hysteresis.
int candidateActionDirection = 0
string candidateActionReason = "NO CLOSED TRIGGER"
if not actionBasisAvailable
    candidateActionReason := "CHART TF EXCEEDS TRIGGER TF"
else if not decisionSameActiveSession
    candidateActionReason := "CURRENT SESSION TRIGGER WARMUP"
else if not decisionReady
    candidateActionReason := decisionWhy
else if decisionDirection == 0
    candidateActionReason := decisionWhy
else if trendRegime == 0
    candidateActionReason := trendStatus == "OK" ? "CONFIRMED TREND IS WAIT" : "TREND " + trendStatus
else if decisionDirection != trendRegime
    candidateActionReason := "COUNTER-TREND CLOSED SIGNAL"
else if requireBlockConfirm and not blockConfirmOK
    candidateActionReason := decisionConfirmation
else if not notExtended
    candidateActionReason := "NO CHASE | EMA DIST " + f_ratio(decisionEMADistance) + " ATR"
else
    candidateActionDirection := decisionDirection
    candidateActionReason := "TREND + NORMALIZED TRIGGER" + (requireBlockConfirm ? " + BLOCK CONFIRM" : "")

// Reversal hysteresis is evaluated once per newly completed trigger bar.
// A WAIT bar does not erase the last accepted side within the session. This
// prevents a later one-bar opposite signal from bypassing the reversal check.
bool newClosedDecision = not na(decisionEnd) and (na(decisionEnd[1]) or decisionEnd != decisionEnd[1])
var int acceptedDecisionDirection = 0
var int reversalCandidateDirection = 0
var int reversalCandidateCount = 0
var int stableDecisionDirection = 0
var string stableDecisionReason = "CLOSED DECISION WARMUP"
var string stableDecisionConfirm = "WAIT | NO CLOSED TRIGGER"
var int stableDecisionEnd = na
var int stableDecisionSession = na

bool activeDecisionSessionChanged = not na(expectedSessionId) and (na(stableDecisionSession) or expectedSessionId != stableDecisionSession)
if activeDecisionSessionChanged
    acceptedDecisionDirection := 0
    reversalCandidateDirection := 0
    reversalCandidateCount := 0
    stableDecisionDirection := 0
    stableDecisionReason := "CURRENT SESSION TRIGGER WARMUP"
    stableDecisionConfirm := "WAIT | NO CURRENT-SESSION CLOSED TRIGGER"
    stableDecisionEnd := na
    stableDecisionSession := expectedSessionId

if not actionBasisAvailable
    stableDecisionDirection := 0
    stableDecisionReason := "CHART TF EXCEEDS TRIGGER TF"
else if newClosedDecision and decisionSameActiveSession
    stableDecisionEnd := decisionEnd
    stableDecisionConfirm := decisionConfirmation
    if candidateActionDirection == 0
        stableDecisionDirection := 0
        stableDecisionReason := candidateActionReason
        reversalCandidateDirection := 0
        reversalCandidateCount := 0
    else if acceptedDecisionDirection == 0 or candidateActionDirection == acceptedDecisionDirection
        acceptedDecisionDirection := candidateActionDirection
        stableDecisionDirection := candidateActionDirection
        stableDecisionReason := candidateActionReason
        reversalCandidateDirection := 0
        reversalCandidateCount := 0
    else
        if reversalCandidateDirection == candidateActionDirection
            reversalCandidateCount += 1
        else
            reversalCandidateDirection := candidateActionDirection
            reversalCandidateCount := 1
        if reversalCandidateCount >= reversalConfirmBars
            acceptedDecisionDirection := candidateActionDirection
            stableDecisionDirection := candidateActionDirection
            stableDecisionReason := candidateActionReason + " | REVERSAL CONFIRMED"
            reversalCandidateDirection := 0
            reversalCandidateCount := 0
        else
            stableDecisionDirection := 0
            stableDecisionReason := "REVERSAL " + str.tostring(reversalCandidateCount) + "/" + str.tostring(reversalConfirmBars) + " | WAIT NEXT CLOSED " + strategyTFText

int actionDirection = stableDecisionDirection
string actionReason = stableDecisionReason

f_notification(string kind, int state, int eventNumber) =>
    string decisionStateText = state == 1 ? "CALL | " + stableDecisionConfirm + " | CLOSED " + strategyTFText : state == -1 ? "PUT | " + stableDecisionConfirm + " | CLOSED " + strategyTFText : "WAIT | " + actionReason + " | CLOSED " + strategyTFText
    string stateText = alertTarget == "DECISION" ? decisionStateText : f_trigger_text(state, alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? closedReady : strategyReady, alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? closedWhy : strategyWhy, alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? closedMOMNorm : strategyMOMNorm, alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? closedDeltaPct : strategyDeltaPct, alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? "CLOSED" : "LIVE")
    "SQ284|" + syminfo.tickerid + "|" + kind + "|" + strategyTFText + "|trend=" + trendTFText + "|" + str.tostring(eventNumber) + " | " + stateText + " | price " + f_price(decisionPrice) + " | MOM/ATR " + f_ratio(decisionMOMNorm) + " | Delta% " + f_percent(decisionDeltaPct) + " | EMA dist " + f_ratio(decisionEMADistance) + " ATR | RESEARCH SIGNAL; NOT AN ORDER"

varip int observedAlertState = na
varip int observedAlertSession = na
varip int lastSentAt = na
varip int eventNumber = 0
bool liveSourceFresh = f_wall_fresh(strategyFeedStart, strategyFeedEnd, timenow) and not na(strategyEnd) and not na(activeSessionId) and strategySession == activeSessionId
int rawAlertDirection = alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? closedDirection : strategyDirection
bool rawAlertReady = alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? closedReady and closedDecisionSupported : strategyReady
int currentAlertState = alertTarget == "DECISION" ? actionDirection : rawAlertDirection
bool currentAlertReady = alertTarget == "DECISION" ? actionBasisAvailable and decisionSameActiveSession and decisionReady : rawAlertReady
int currentAlertSession = alertTarget == "DECISION" ? decisionSession : alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" ? closedSession : strategySession
bool sameAlertSession = not na(observedAlertSession) and currentAlertSession == observedAlertSession
bool alertChanged = currentAlertReady and liveSourceFresh and sameAlertSession and not na(observedAlertState) and currentAlertState != observedAlertState
bool mayNotify = na(lastSentAt) or timenow - lastSentAt >= alertCooldown * 1000
if barstate.isrealtime
    if liveAlerts and alertChanged and mayNotify and (currentAlertState != 0 or notifyWAIT)
        eventNumber += 1
        alert(f_notification(alertTarget, currentAlertState, eventNumber), alert.freq_all)
        lastSentAt := timenow
    observedAlertState := currentAlertReady and liveSourceFresh ? currentAlertState : na
    observedAlertSession := currentAlertReady and liveSourceFresh ? currentAlertSession : na

// Optional distance context. Always uses a preceding completed strategy ATR,
// not the old hard-coded developing 15m ATR. Never an entry/stop/target engine.
float riskATR = na
if showRiskGuide
    if timeframe.in_seconds(signalTF) >= timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.main_period)
        riskATR := request.security(chartSessionTicker, signalTF, ta.atr(14)[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
    else
        riskATR := request.security(chartSessionTicker, signalTF, ta.atr(14)[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
string riskGuide = "ATR " + f_price(riskATR) + " | 2x " + f_price(2.0 * riskATR) + " | 4x " + f_price(4.0 * riskATR)
string riskTip = "ATR14 from the preceding completed strategy bar (" + strategyTFText + "), not a developing fixed-15m value. On larger host charts this is a sampled preceding strategy bar, not every intrabar event. 2x/4x distances only; no entry anchor, position or exit engine. These are not stop/target recommendations or frozen orders. OFF by default."

// ── Prior daily source + exactly two trading ranges ─────────────────────────
bool trOnDailyChart = timeframe.isdaily and timeframe.multiplier == 1
bool trOnIntradayChart = timeframe.isseconds or timeframe.isminutes
bool trTimeframeOK = trOnDailyChart or trOnIntradayChart
float dailyPrevHigh = na
float dailyPrevLow = na
float dailyPrevClose = na
int dailyStart = na
int dailyPrevStart = na
int dailyPrevEnd = na
if trOnIntradayChart
    [dHigh, dLow, dClose, dStart, dPrevStart, dPrevEnd] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "1D", [high[1], low[1], close[1], time, time[1], time_close[1]], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on, ignore_invalid_symbol=true)
    dailyPrevHigh := dHigh
    dailyPrevLow := dLow
    dailyPrevClose := dClose
    dailyStart := dStart
    dailyPrevStart := dPrevStart
    dailyPrevEnd := dPrevEnd
else if trOnDailyChart
    dailyPrevHigh := high[1]
    dailyPrevLow := low[1]
    dailyPrevClose := close[1]
    dailyStart := time
    dailyPrevStart := time[1]
    dailyPrevEnd := time_close[1]

// TR means Trading Range here: actual Low-High of one bar, not Wilder TR.
// Chart TR follows the visible chart bar and therefore changes automatically
// when the user changes the TradingView chart timeframe.
bool chartTRReady = not na(low) and not na(high) and high >= low
float chartTRLow = chartTRReady ? low : na
float chartTRHigh = chartTRReady ? high : na
float chartTRWidth = chartTRReady ? high - low : na

// Hourly TR is the current chart-selected-session 1h bar Low-High.
// • On chart TF <= 1h, it is rebuilt causally from aligned visible chart bars.
// • On 4h/1D charts, lookahead_off requests the latest available 1h intrabar,
//   which gives the current/last 1h Low-High without pretending the 4h/1D OHLC
//   can itself reconstruct every hourly bar. RTH/extended/24h follow the active
//   named chart session through chartSessionTicker.
float chartSeconds = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.main_period)
bool hourlyFromChartBarsSupported = not na(chartSeconds) and chartSeconds > 0 and chartSeconds <= 3600
bool hourlyTFAligned = hourlyFromChartBarsSupported and 3600 % int(chartSeconds) == 0
int chartBuiltHourStart = hourlyTFAligned ? time("60") : na
int chartBuiltHourEnd = hourlyTFAligned ? time_close("60") : na
bool hourlyBarInsideParent = hourlyTFAligned and not na(chartBuiltHourStart) and not na(chartBuiltHourEnd) and time >= chartBuiltHourStart and time_close <= chartBuiltHourEnd

bool hourlyFromLTFSupported = not na(chartSeconds) and chartSeconds > 3600 and chartSeconds <= 86400
float requestedHourlyLow = na
float requestedHourlyHigh = na
int requestedHourlyStart = na
int requestedHourlyEnd = na
if hourlyFromLTFSupported
    [hLo, hHi, hStart, hEnd] = request.security(chartSessionTicker, "60", [low, high, time, time_close], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off, ignore_invalid_symbol=true, calc_bars_count=1500)
    requestedHourlyLow := hLo
    requestedHourlyHigh := hHi
    requestedHourlyStart := hStart
    requestedHourlyEnd := hEnd

var int activeHourlyParent = na
var float hourlyTRLow = na
var float hourlyTRHigh = na
int hourlyParentStart = na
int hourlyParentEnd = na
if hourlyBarInsideParent
    bool newHourlyParent = na(activeHourlyParent) or chartBuiltHourStart != activeHourlyParent
    if newHourlyParent
        activeHourlyParent := chartBuiltHourStart
        hourlyTRLow := low
        hourlyTRHigh := high
    else
        hourlyTRLow := math.min(hourlyTRLow, low)
        hourlyTRHigh := math.max(hourlyTRHigh, high)
    hourlyParentStart := chartBuiltHourStart
    hourlyParentEnd := chartBuiltHourEnd
else if hourlyFromLTFSupported
    activeHourlyParent := requestedHourlyStart
    hourlyTRLow := requestedHourlyLow
    hourlyTRHigh := requestedHourlyHigh
    hourlyParentStart := requestedHourlyStart
    hourlyParentEnd := requestedHourlyEnd

bool hourlyTRSupported = hourlyFromChartBarsSupported or hourlyFromLTFSupported
bool hourlyTRReady = hourlyTRSupported and not na(hourlyParentStart) and not na(hourlyParentEnd) and not na(hourlyTRLow) and not na(hourlyTRHigh) and hourlyTRHigh >= hourlyTRLow
float hourlyTRWidth = hourlyTRReady ? hourlyTRHigh - hourlyTRLow : na
bool hourlyTRPartial = hourlyTRReady and hourlyParentEnd - hourlyParentStart < 3600000
bool hourlyTRLowerSnapshot = hourlyTRReady and hourlyFromLTFSupported

// ── DAILY Traditional pivot points: P / R1 / S1 ONLY ───────────────────────────
// Official formulas: tradingview.com/support/solutions/43000521824/
// HTF prices use [1] + lookahead_on: previous completed DAILY values, not
// high[1]/low[1] from the chart timeframe and not the developing daily candle.
// Unshifted daily time below is a period identity, NOT future price information.
// Native daily data is deliberate: stocks generally exclude extended-hours
// trades; futures daily bars may use ETH and settlement as close. Those levels
// can differ from pivots rebuilt from an intraday-only RTH session.
bool pivotPricesOK = not na(dailyPrevHigh) and not na(dailyPrevLow) and not na(dailyPrevClose) and dailyPrevHigh >= dailyPrevLow
bool pivotTimesOK = not na(dailyStart) and not na(dailyPrevStart) and not na(dailyPrevEnd) and dailyPrevStart < dailyStart and dailyPrevEnd <= time
bool pivotReadyBase = trTimeframeOK and pivotPricesOK and pivotTimesOK
float pivotRawP = pivotReadyBase ? (dailyPrevHigh + dailyPrevLow + dailyPrevClose) / 3.0 : na
float pivotRawR1 = pivotReadyBase ? 2.0 * pivotRawP - dailyPrevLow : na
float pivotRawS1 = pivotReadyBase ? 2.0 * pivotRawP - dailyPrevHigh : na
// Arithmetic regression guard. Reverse the displayed formulas back into H/L/C.
// This should be exact apart from floating-point noise; if future edits break a
// formula, the pivot is withheld instead of silently drawing a wrong level.
float pivotAuditHigh = pivotReadyBase ? 2.0 * pivotRawP - pivotRawS1 : na
float pivotAuditLow = pivotReadyBase ? 2.0 * pivotRawP - pivotRawR1 : na
float pivotAuditClose = pivotReadyBase ? 3.0 * pivotRawP - dailyPrevHigh - dailyPrevLow : na
float pivotTol = math.max(syminfo.mintick * 0.001, 1e-8)
bool pivotMathOK = pivotReadyBase and math.abs(pivotAuditHigh - dailyPrevHigh) <= pivotTol and math.abs(pivotAuditLow - dailyPrevLow) <= pivotTol and math.abs(pivotAuditClose - dailyPrevClose) <= pivotTol
// Close normally sits inside that day's H/L. Do not make this a hard failure for
// futures because settlement can legitimately differ from the last traded print.
bool pivotCloseInside = pivotReadyBase and dailyPrevClose >= dailyPrevLow - syminfo.mintick and dailyPrevClose <= dailyPrevHigh + syminfo.mintick
bool pivotSourceSanityOK = syminfo.type == "futures" ? pivotReadyBase : pivotCloseInside
bool pivotReady = pivotReadyBase and pivotMathOK and pivotSourceSanityOK
string pivotStatus = not trTimeframeOK ? "USE INTRADAY / 1D" : not pivotPricesOK ? "NO VALID PREV DAILY HLC" : not pivotTimesOK ? "DAILY TIME CHECK" : not pivotMathOK ? "PIVOT MATH CHECK FAILED" : not pivotSourceSanityOK ? "PREV CLOSE OUTSIDE H/L" : "OK"
float dailyP = pivotReady ? pivotRawP : na
float dailyR1 = pivotReady ? pivotRawR1 : na
float dailyS1 = pivotReady ? pivotRawS1 : na
string pivotDate = na(dailyStart) ? "N/A" : str.format_time(dailyStart, "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm", syminfo.timezone)
string pivotSourceDate = na(dailyPrevStart) ? "N/A" : str.format_time(dailyPrevStart, "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm", syminfo.timezone)
string pivotTip = "Traditional DAILY P=(H+L+C)/3; R1=2P-L; S1=2P-H. Native previous completed 1D source: " + syminfo.tickerid + ". Active daily period starts " + pivotDate + "; previous daily bar starts " + pivotSourceDate + " " + syminfo.timezone + ". Exact source H=" + f_price(dailyPrevHigh) + "; L=" + f_price(dailyPrevLow) + "; C=" + f_price(dailyPrevClose) + ". Arithmetic audit reverses P/R1/S1 back to H/L/C before levels are released. Non-futures also require previous close to sit inside H/L within one minimum tick. No current-price input; no right-side confirmation delay. Intraday timeframe changes do not change the DAILY basis. Native daily feeds can differ from intraday-session OHLC; futures close may be settlement. Independent of the selected intraday session engine. Only reference levels, not orders, predicted day limits or extra MOM gates. Status: " + pivotStatus

// One reusable central Pivot line on the PRICE chart. S1/R1 remain table/data-window
// references only. Separate scale-only plot below creates the P right-axis tag.
// bar_time coordinates support long intraday histories without bar_index limits.
// Only the latest daily set is shown; older days are not retroactively painted.
var line pLine = na
if barstate.islast
    if showPivots and pivotReady
        int levelStart = math.min(dailyStart, time)
        int levelEnd = time_close
        if na(pLine)
            pLine := line.new(levelStart, dailyP, levelEnd, dailyP, xloc=xloc.bar_time, extend=extend.right, color=pivotPColor, width=2, force_overlay=true)
        else
            line.set_xy1(pLine, levelStart, dailyP)
            line.set_xy2(pLine, levelEnd, dailyP)
    else
        if not na(pLine)
            line.delete(pLine)
            pLine := na

// Local chart MOM/EMA drawings and supporting rows follow the visible chart TF.
color liveMOMColor = f_move_color(momArrowChange)
color liveMOM2Color = f_move_color(mom6ArrowChange)
plot(showHistogram ? mom : na, "CHART MOM optional histogram", color=color.new(liveMOMColor,55), style=plot.style_columns, display=display.pane)
plot(mom, "CHART primary MOM", color=liveMOMColor, linewidth=momLineWidth, style=plot.style_linebr, display=display.pane + display.data_window + display.price_scale)
plot(showSecondMOM ? mom6 : na, "CHART MOM6 context", color=liveMOM2Color, linewidth=2, style=plot.style_linebr, display=display.pane + display.data_window + display.price_scale)
hline(0, "MOM zero", color=color.new(chart.fg_color,30))
plot(openRealtimeBar ? mom : na, "Local live endpoint", color=liveMOMColor, style=plot.style_circles, linewidth=4, display=display.pane)
plot(showSecondMOM and openRealtimeBar ? mom6 : na, "Local MOM6 live endpoint", color=liveMOM2Color, style=plot.style_circles, linewidth=3, display=display.pane)
plot(showEMA ? ema : na, "CHART EMA", color=emaColor, linewidth=2, force_overlay=true, display=display.pane)
// Session VWAP remains calculation/Data Window context only. It is not drawn
// on the price chart and never enters TREND, RAW TRIGGER or DECISION.

// Right-axis price tags for the current Daily Pivot set. display.price_scale keeps
// these plots off the chart body while exposing clean native-style price boxes.
plot(showPivots and pivotReady ? dailyP : na, "Daily Pivot P price tag", color=pivotPColor, force_overlay=true, display=display.price_scale)

// Exactly two dashboard trading ranges; neither draws a line on price.
string chartTRText = chartTRReady ? f_price(chartTRLow) + " - " + f_price(chartTRHigh) + " (" + f_price(chartTRWidth) + " pts)" : "N/A"
string hourlyTRText = hourlyTRReady ? f_price(hourlyTRLow) + " - " + f_price(hourlyTRHigh) + " (" + f_price(hourlyTRWidth) + " pts)" + (hourlyTRLowerSnapshot ? " | 1h SNAPSHOT" : "") + (hourlyTRPartial ? " | PARTIAL SESSION BAR" : "") : not hourlyTRSupported ? "N/A | USE CHART TF <= 1D" : hourlyFromChartBarsSupported and not hourlyTFAligned ? "N/A | USE 1h-DIVISIBLE TF" : hourlyFromChartBarsSupported ? "N/A | BAR/PARENT MISALIGNMENT" : "N/A | 1h SOURCE PENDING"
string chartTRTip = "Chart-TF trading range on " + tfText + ": current visible chart bar LOW-HIGH only. It updates with the live bar and changes automatically when the chart timeframe changes. It is not a " + str.tostring(momLen) + "-bar/12-bar lookback and not Wilder True Range. No line is drawn."
string hourlyTRTip = "Hourly trading range for the active TradingView chart session (" + chartSessionName + "): RTH follows RTH, extended follows extended, and 24h follows 24h. On chart TF <= 1h it accumulates only observed aligned chart bars inside the current 1h parent. On 4h/1D charts it uses the latest available native 1h intrabar with lookahead_off and labels it 1h SNAPSHOT. No future hourly high/low is used; any shortened final session bar is labelled partial. No line is drawn."

// One observation status, not repeated timeframe/live labels on every row.
// `session.islastbar` refers to the selected named chart session, not always RTH.
bool sourceBarUpdating = barstate.isrealtime
bool reportedSelectedClose = session.islastbar and timenow >= time_close
bool panelOffSession = reportedSelectedClose
// Delay/staleness is a warning, never a missing-data gate. Pine cannot infer
// the subscription or distinguish a delayed feed from a halted/stale feed here.
int feedAgeBoundMs = na(localFeedEnd) ? na : math.max(0, timenow - localFeedEnd)
bool feedTimeCheck = sourceBarUpdating and not na(feedAgeBoundMs) and feedAgeBoundMs > 90000
bool viewLive = sourceBarUpdating and not panelOffSession and not feedTimeCheck
bool largerChartSampling = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.main_period) > timeframe.in_seconds(signalTF)
string observationState = panelOffSession ? (sourceBarUpdating ? "OFF SESSION | FEED VALUES" : "OFF SESSION | LAST VALUES") : feedTimeCheck ? "DELAYED / STALE | FEED VALUES" : viewLive ? "UPDATING | FEED VALUES" : "LAST CLOSED"
string alertWarning = liveAlerts and alertMode == "Closed strategy bars" and not closedAlertSupported ? " | CLOSED ALERTS BLOCKED" : liveAlerts and not f_wall_fresh(strategyFeedStart, strategyFeedEnd, timenow) ? " | ALERTS PAUSED" : ""
observationState += largerChartSampling ? " | LTF SNAPSHOT" : ""
observationState += sameBasisMismatch ? " | BASIS CHECK" : alertWarning

// Preserve last aligned CHART-TF flow values for off-session inspection.
// Trigger-basis flow still powers RAW TRIGGER/DECISION internally, but the
// supporting EST FLOW row follows the visible chart timeframe.
var float lastChartDelta = na
var float lastChartDeltaPct = na
var float lastChartCVD = na
var float lastChartChange = na
var float lastChartChangePct = na
var string lastChartFlowStatus = "NO SESSION HISTORY"
var string lastChartDeltaStatus = "NO SESSION HISTORY"
var string lastChartChangeStatus = "NO SESSION HISTORY"
var int lastStrategyAt = na
var int lastChartAt = na
var int lastFlowAt = na
if not na(strategyEnd)
    lastStrategyAt := strategyEnd
if not na(localEnd)
    lastChartAt := localEnd
if flowClockAligned
    lastChartDelta := barDelta
    lastChartDeltaPct := chartDeltaPct
    lastChartCVD := sessionCVD
    lastChartChange := cvdRecentChange
    lastChartChangePct := chartChangePct
    lastChartFlowStatus := flowStatus
    lastChartDeltaStatus := deltaStatus
    lastChartChangeStatus := changeStatus
    lastFlowAt := flowAsOf

bool useLastChartFlow = panelOffSession
float displayDelta = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartDelta : barDelta
float displayDeltaPct = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartDeltaPct : chartDeltaPct
float displayCVD = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartCVD : sessionCVD
float displayChange = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartChange : cvdRecentChange
float displayChangePct = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartChangePct : chartChangePct
string displayFlowStatus = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartFlowStatus : flowStatus
string displayDeltaStatus = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartDeltaStatus : deltaStatus
string displayChangeStatus = useLastChartFlow ? lastChartChangeStatus : changeStatus

string actionBasisText = "CLOSED " + strategyTFText
string topTrendText = f_trend_text(trendRegime, trendADX, trendDISpread, trendEMASlope, trendTF, trendStatus)
color topTrendColor = f_trend_color(trendRegime)
string triggerBasisText = largerChartSampling ? "LIVE " + strategyTFText + " SNAPSHOT" : "LIVE " + strategyTFText
string topTriggerText = f_trigger_text(strategyDirection, strategyReady, strategyWhy, strategyMOMNorm, strategyDeltaPct, triggerBasisText)
color topTriggerColor = f_trigger_color(strategyDirection, strategyReady)
string topDecisionText = actionDirection == 1 ? "CALL | " + stableDecisionConfirm + " | " + actionBasisText : actionDirection == -1 ? "PUT | " + stableDecisionConfirm + " | " + actionBasisText : "WAIT | " + actionReason + " | " + actionBasisText
color topDecisionColor = actionDirection != 0 ? f_action_color(actionDirection) : (str.contains(actionReason, "REVERSAL") or decisionDirection != 0 ? color.orange : color.gray)

float strategyMOM6 = not na(strategyMOM) and not na(strategyPriorMOM) ? strategyMOM + strategyPriorMOM : na
float strategyMOM6Prev = not na(strategyMPrev) and not na(strategyPriorMPrev) ? strategyMPrev + strategyPriorMPrev : na
float strategyMomMoveBand = momMoveAtrFrac == 0 ? 0.0 : not na(strategyATR) ? math.max(syminfo.mintick, strategyATR * momMoveAtrFrac) : syminfo.mintick
float strategyMomMoveRaw = strategyMOM - strategyMPrev
float strategyMOM6MoveRaw = strategyMOM6 - strategyMOM6Prev
float strategyMomArrowChange = na(strategyMomMoveRaw) ? na : math.abs(strategyMomMoveRaw) <= strategyMomMoveBand ? 0.0 : strategyMomMoveRaw
float strategyMOM6ArrowChange = na(strategyMOM6MoveRaw) ? na : math.abs(strategyMOM6MoveRaw) <= strategyMomMoveBand ? 0.0 : strategyMOM6MoveRaw
color strategyMOMColor = f_move_color(strategyMomArrowChange)
color strategyMOM6Color = f_move_color(strategyMOM6ArrowChange)

float chartDISpread = not na(plusDI) and not na(minusDI) and (plusDI + minusDI) > 0 ? (plusDI - minusDI) / (plusDI + minusDI) : na
float chartAdxMoveRaw = adx - adxPrevious
float chartAdxMove = na(chartAdxMoveRaw) ? na : math.abs(chartAdxMoveRaw) < 0.10 ? 0.0 : chartAdxMoveRaw
color chartDmiColor = na(chartDISpread) ? color.gray : chartDISpread > 0 ? color.teal : chartDISpread < 0 ? color.red : color.gray
string chartDmiTip = "DMI/ADX supporting context on the visible " + tfText + " chart. OVERALL TREND still uses confirmed " + trendTFText + "; this row does not override it."
string chartEmaTip = "EMA" + str.tostring(emaLen) + " supporting context on the visible " + tfText + " chart. RAW TRIGGER/DECISION keep their independent trigger-TF EMA no-chase calculation."

string updateTip = "SQ+ v2.8.4 | " + syminfo.tickerid + ". Active named chart session=" + chartSessionName + ". Overall trend=" + trendTFText + " previous completed bar; raw trigger=" + strategyTFText + " developing bar; DECISION=" + actionBasisText + " with " + str.tostring(reversalConfirmBars) + "-bar opposite-side hysteresis. Supporting dashboard rows and pane=" + tfText + " CHART context; only Trend/Trigger/Decision keep their independent bases. Session identity uses the selected-session ticker plus time_tradingday. Source-window identity, not timenow, controls calculation alignment. UPDATING does not certify exchange-real-time entitlement. Historical values are not described as current-market data."
string statusTip = "Observation: " + observationState + ". " + updateTip + " Display zone=" + zone + ". Last trigger=" + f_time(lastStrategyAt) + "; chart=" + f_time(lastChartAt) + "; flow=" + f_time(lastFlowAt) + ". Native trigger minute=" + f_time(strategyFeedStart) + ".." + f_time(strategyFeedEnd) + "; RVOL source minute=" + f_time(volumeSourceStart) + ".." + f_time(volumeSourceEnd) + ". Window endpoints are not exchange last-tick timestamps. Wall-age lower bound=" + (na(feedAgeBoundMs) ? "N/A" : str.tostring(float(feedAgeBoundMs) / 60000.0, "0.0")) + " minutes."
string trendTip = "OVERALL TREND uses the previous completed " + trendTFText + " bar from the active named chart session (" + chartSessionName + "). Intraday bars must have the full requested duration and the same time_tradingday as the current selected session; status=" + trendStatus + ". Therefore RTH warms up from the RTH open, extended from the extended-session open, and 24h from the 24h session open. A shortened final session fragment cannot masquerade as a full 1h/4h bar. DMI side is normalized as (+DI--DI)/(+DI+-DI); ADX enters at " + f_num(adxEnter) + " and exits below " + f_num(adxExit) + " to reduce threshold chatter. Minimum |DI spread|=" + f_percent(diSpreadMin) + ". Trend is a DECISION gate, while RAW TRIGGER remains visible when counter-trend. " + statusTip
string triggerTip = "RAW TRIGGER on the developing " + strategyTFText + " bar. BULL requires MOM/ATR >= " + f_num(momAtrMin) + " and estimated Delta/bar-volume >= " + f_percent(deltaPctMin) + "; BEAR requires both below the negative thresholds. Estimated flow is participation context, not verified bid/ask aggressor order flow. " + strategyWhy + ". " + statusTip
string decisionTip = "DECISION combines confirmation and CALL / PUT / WAIT. It uses only the previous completed " + strategyTFText + " trigger bar plus the confirmed overall trend, the preceding non-overlapping MOM block and EMA no-chase distance. RAW TRIGGER remains the live aggressive preview. After an accepted side, an opposite side needs " + str.tostring(reversalConfirmBars) + " consecutive completed trigger bars; the first opposite bar remains WAIT. State resets at each chart-selected trading session, so a prior-session decision cannot carry into the next selected-session open. A higher-timeframe trend changing to WAIT blocks new decisions but is not an automatic exit rule. EMA no-chase limit=" + f_num(maxEmaDistanceAtr) + " ATR. Research state only; not an order or position manager."
string strategyMomTip = "Trigger-basis MOM remains internal to RAW TRIGGER/DECISION on " + strategyTFText + ". Supporting MOM rows follow the visible chart timeframe."
string strategyMOM6Tip = "Trigger-basis MOM6 remains available in Data Window only. Dashboard MOM rows follow the visible chart timeframe; DECISION keeps the preceding non-overlapping block internally."
string chartMomTip = "CHART MOM" + str.tostring(momLen) + " on " + tfText + ": " + f_price(localClose) + " - " + f_price(momRef) + ". This supporting row follows consecutive visible chart bars. When CHART TF differs from Trigger TF it may span chart-session boundaries; the official trigger remains independently session-strict. " + chartWhy + "."
string chartMOM6Tip = "CHART MOM" + str.tostring(momContextLen) + " on " + tfText + ": close - close[" + str.tostring(momContextLen) + "]. It uses consecutive chart bars for display context, including across sessions when CHART TF differs from Trigger TF. DECISION still uses its separate session-strict trigger-TF non-overlapping confirmation block."
string flowTip = (isIndex ? "NATIVE INDEX " + flowTicker + "; vendor reference volume only. " : "NATIVE " + flowTicker + ". ") + "Active named chart session=" + chartSessionName + "; CHART basis=" + tfText + "; estimator=" + flowEstimator + ". Range-weighted mode uses V*(close-open)/(high-low), clipped to +/-V; legacy mode uses whole-bar sign. Δ1 is the current chart parent-bar estimate; Δ" + str.tostring(cvdLen) + " is chart-basis context only. Session=" + displayFlowStatus + "; Δ1=" + displayDeltaStatus + "; Δ" + str.tostring(cvdLen) + "=" + displayChangeStatus + ". Not verified bid/ask aggressor CVD."
string volumeTip = "Native chart-selected-session 1m source " + chartSessionTicker + "; named session=" + chartSessionName + "; RVOL basis=" + tfText + " " + rvolMode + "; median across " + str.tostring(rvolN) + " complete prior matching windows. It is chart context only and never enters TREND, RAW TRIGGER or DECISION. VWAP status=" + vwapStatus + "; RVOL status=" + rvolStatus + "."
string rvolText = na(rvol) ? "N/A | " + rvolStatus : (volumeIsReference or panelOffSession or not sourceBarUpdating ? "LAST " : "") + f_num(rvol) + "x" + (str.contains(rvolStatus, "PREV BAR") ? " | PREV BAR" : str.contains(rvolStatus, "CLOSED SAMPLE") ? " | CLOSED SAMPLE" : "")
string flowPrefix = useLastChartFlow or panelOffSession or not sourceBarUpdating ? "LAST " : ""
string rvolLabel = (rvolMode == "Chart bar" ? "RVOL BAR " : "RVOL SESSION ") + tfText + (isIndex ? "* EST" : " EST")
string dailyCombinedText = "P " + (pivotReady ? f_price(dailyP) : "N/A") + " | S1/R1 " + (pivotReady ? f_price(dailyS1) + "/" + f_price(dailyR1) : "N/A")
string dailyCombinedTip = pivotTip + " Daily P/S1/R1 remain previous-day reference levels; they are separate from the two live trading-range rows."

// Detailed provenance stays in tooltips; common status text stays compact.
f_compact_status(string status) =>
    status == "SOURCE COVERAGE NOT VERIFIED" ? "SESSION COVERAGE" : status == "SESSION START NOT OBSERVED" ? "PARTIAL HISTORY" : status == "INTERVAL COVERAGE NOT VERIFIED" ? "INTERVAL COVERAGE" : status == "INTERVAL START NOT OBSERVED" ? "PARTIAL INTERVAL" : status == "NO SOURCE HISTORY" ? "NO HISTORY" : status == "NO USABLE VOLUME" ? "NO VOLUME" : status == "ZERO SESSION VOLUME" ? "ZERO VOLUME" : status == "ZERO BAR VOLUME" ? "ZERO BAR VOL" : status

// No VWAP end label: the only script price overlays are EMA20 and Pivot P.

// Fixed allocation from input-only row flags; no intrabar row-count drift.
int usedRows = 5 + (showSecondMOM ? 1 : 0) + (showFlow ? 1 : 0) + (showEMArow ? 1 : 0) + (showChartTRRow ? 1 : 0) + (showHourlyTRRow ? 1 : 0) + (showPivotRow ? 1 : 0) + (showRiskGuide ? 1 : 0) + (showRVOLrow ? 1 : 0)
var table panel = table.new(panelPosition, 2, usedRows, bgcolor=chart.bg_color, frame_color=color.new(chart.fg_color, 65), frame_width=1, force_overlay=true)
if barstate.islast
    if showTable
        int r = 0
        f_row(panel, r, "OVERALL TREND", topTrendText, panelOffSession or feedTimeCheck ? color.gray : topTrendColor, trendTip)
        r += 1
        f_row(panel, r, "RAW TRIGGER", topTriggerText, sameBasisMismatch or panelOffSession or feedTimeCheck ? color.gray : topTriggerColor, triggerTip)
        table.cell_set_bgcolor(panel, 1, r, color.new(sameBasisMismatch ? color.orange : topTriggerColor, 85))
        r += 1
        f_row(panel, r, "DECISION", topDecisionText, panelOffSession or feedTimeCheck ? color.gray : topDecisionColor, decisionTip)
        table.cell_set_bgcolor(panel, 1, r, color.new(topDecisionColor, 84))
        r += 1

        f_row(panel, r, "DMI / ADX " + tfText + " CHART", na(adx) or na(chartDISpread) ? "WARMUP" : f_adx_strength(adx, chartAdxMove, plusDI, minusDI, chartDISpread), chartDmiColor, chartDmiTip)
        r += 1
        f_row(panel, r, "MOM" + str.tostring(momLen) + " " + tfText, f_mom_display(mom, momArrowChange) + " | /ATR " + f_ratio(chartMOMNorm), liveMOMColor, chartMomTip)
        r += 1
        if showSecondMOM
            f_row(panel, r, "MOM" + str.tostring(momContextLen) + " " + tfText, f_mom_display(mom6, mom6ArrowChange), liveMOM2Color, chartMOM6Tip)
            r += 1
        if showFlow
            bool hasDelta1 = not na(displayDelta)
            bool hasContextChange = not na(displayChange)
            string cvdBase = na(displayCVD) ? "CVD N/A | " + f_compact_status(displayFlowStatus) : "CVD " + f_vol(displayCVD)
            string delta1Text = hasDelta1 ? "Δ1 " + f_vol(displayDelta) + " (" + f_percent(displayDeltaPct) + ")" : "Δ1 " + f_compact_status(displayDeltaStatus)
            string contextText = hasContextChange ? "Δ" + str.tostring(cvdLen) + " " + f_vol(displayChange) + " (" + f_percent(displayChangePct) + ")" : "Δ" + str.tostring(cvdLen) + " " + f_compact_status(displayChangeStatus)
            string cvdText = flowPrefix + cvdBase + " | " + delta1Text + " | " + contextText
            color cvdColor = na(displayCVD) and not hasDelta1 and not hasContextChange ? color.gray : chart.fg_color
            f_row(panel, r, "EST FLOW " + tfText + flowTableSuffix, cvdText, cvdColor, flowTip)
            r += 1
        if showEMArow
            string emaPos = na(ema) ? "WARMUP" : f_price(ema) + " | PRICE " + (localClose > ema ? "ABOVE" : localClose < ema ? "BELOW" : "AT") + " | DIST " + f_ratio(localEMADistance) + " ATR"
            color emaRowColor = na(localEMADistance) ? color.gray : math.abs(localEMADistance) > maxEmaDistanceAtr ? color.orange : emaColor
            f_row(panel, r, "EMA " + str.tostring(emaLen) + " " + tfText, emaPos, emaRowColor, chartEmaTip)
            r += 1
        if showChartTRRow
            f_row(panel, r, "TR CHART " + tfText, chartTRText, chartTRReady ? trRangeColor : color.gray, chartTRTip)
            r += 1
        if showHourlyTRRow
            f_row(panel, r, "TR HOURLY 1h [" + chartSessionName + "]", hourlyTRText, hourlyTRReady ? trRangeColor : color.gray, hourlyTRTip)
            r += 1
        if showPivotRow
            f_row(panel, r, "PIVOT DAILY", dailyCombinedText, pivotReady ? chart.fg_color : color.gray, dailyCombinedTip)
            r += 1
        if showRiskGuide
            f_row(panel, r, "ATR DISTANCES", riskGuide, chart.fg_color, riskTip)
            r += 1
        if showRVOLrow
            f_row(panel, r, rvolLabel, rvolText, chart.fg_color, volumeTip)
            r += 1
        if r != usedRows
            runtime.error("Internal dashboard row allocation mismatch.")
    else
        table.clear(panel, 0, 0, 1, usedRows - 1)

// Local chart MOM pane and supporting dashboard rows follow the visible chart TF.
// They remain separate from independent Trend/Trigger/Decision calculations.
var table paneBadge = table.new(position.top_left, 1, 2, bgcolor=color.new(chart.bg_color, 10))
var label momEndLabel = na
var label priorMomEndLabel = na
if barstate.islast
    if showPaneBadge
        table.cell(paneBadge, 0, 0, "CHART MOM" + str.tostring(momLen) + " | " + f_mom_display(mom, momArrowChange), text_color=liveMOMColor, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left, tooltip=chartMomTip)
        table.cell(paneBadge, 0, 1, showSecondMOM ? "CHART MOM" + str.tostring(momContextLen) + " | " + f_mom_display(mom6, mom6ArrowChange) : "", text_color=liveMOM2Color, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left, tooltip=chartMOM6Tip)
        if momReady
            if na(momEndLabel)
                momEndLabel := label.new(bar_index + 2, mom, "MOM" + str.tostring(momLen) + " " + f_mom(mom), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(chart.bg_color, 12), textcolor=liveMOMColor, size=size.small)
            else
                label.set_xy(momEndLabel, bar_index + 2, mom)
                label.set_text(momEndLabel, "MOM" + str.tostring(momLen) + " " + f_mom(mom))
                label.set_textcolor(momEndLabel, liveMOMColor)
        if showSecondMOM and priorMomReady
            if na(priorMomEndLabel)
                priorMomEndLabel := label.new(bar_index + 4, mom6, "MOM" + str.tostring(momContextLen) + " " + f_mom(mom6), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(chart.bg_color, 12), textcolor=liveMOM2Color, size=size.small)
            else
                label.set_xy(priorMomEndLabel, bar_index + 4, mom6)
                label.set_text(priorMomEndLabel, "MOM" + str.tostring(momContextLen) + " " + f_mom(mom6))
                label.set_textcolor(priorMomEndLabel, liveMOM2Color)
    else
        table.clear(paneBadge, 0, 0, 0, 1)
    if not showPaneBadge or not momReady
        if not na(momEndLabel)
            label.delete(momEndLabel)
            momEndLabel := na
    if not showPaneBadge or not showSecondMOM or not priorMomReady
        if not na(priorMomEndLabel)
            label.delete(priorMomEndLabel)
            priorMomEndLabel := na

// Compact Data Window audit. Redundant source timestamps and internal
// reference plots were removed in v2.7.2 to remain safely below the
// TradingView 64-plot-count ceiling. Their calculations still power
// the dashboard/tooltips and validation guards.
plot(actionDirection, "DECISION CALL=1 WAIT=0 PUT=-1", display=display.data_window)
plot(trendRegime, "Confirmed trend BULL=1 WAIT=0 BEAR=-1", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyDirection, "RAW trigger BULL=1 WAIT=0 BEAR=-1", display=display.data_window)
plot(chartDirection, "Chart diagnostic direction 1/0/-1", display=display.data_window)
plot(trendADX, "Confirmed trend ADX", display=display.data_window)
plot(trendDISpread, "Confirmed normalized DI spread", display=display.data_window)
plot(trendEMA, "Confirmed trend EMA", display=display.data_window)
plot(trendEMASlope, "Confirmed trend EMA slope", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyMOM, "Trigger MOM3/current block", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyMOM6, "Trigger MOM6/cumulative context", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyPriorMOM, "Decision preceding non-overlapping MOM block", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyMOMNorm, "Trigger MOM / prior ATR", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyDelta, "Trigger estimated Delta 1", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyDeltaPct, "Trigger estimated Delta 1 / bar volume", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyChange, "Trigger estimated multi-bar Delta", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyChangePct, "Trigger estimated multi-bar Delta / volume", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyEMA, "Trigger EMA", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyEMADistance, "Trigger price distance from EMA / ATR", display=display.data_window)
plot(strategyReady ? 1 : 0, "Trigger data ready", display=display.data_window)
plot(decisionReady ? 1 : 0, "DECISION closed-trigger data ready", display=display.data_window)
plot(barDelta, "Chart estimated Delta 1 diagnostic", display=display.data_window)
plot(chartDeltaPct, "Chart estimated Delta 1 / volume diagnostic", display=display.data_window)
plot(sessionCVD, "Chart session estimated CVD diagnostic", display=display.data_window)
plot(cvdRecentChange, "Chart multi-bar estimated Delta diagnostic", display=display.data_window)
plot(rvol, "Chart-basis RVOL median estimate", display=display.data_window)
plot(sessionVWAP, "Native session VWAP reference", display=display.data_window)
plot(chartTRLow, "Chart-TF current trading-range low", display=display.data_window)
plot(chartTRHigh, "Chart-TF current trading-range high", display=display.data_window)
plot(hourlyTRLow, "Current 1h trading-range low", display=display.data_window)
plot(hourlyTRHigh, "Current 1h trading-range high", display=display.data_window)
plot(dailyP, "Daily Traditional P", display=display.data_window)
plot(dailyR1, "Daily Traditional R1", display=display.data_window)
plot(dailyS1, "Daily Traditional S1", display=display.data_window)

// Native TradingView compilation and live/reload checks are still required.
// Saved alerts retain a snapshot of script/settings: recreate them for v2.8.4.
// No API keys, broker integration, ETF fallback or hidden cross-symbol substitution.
